^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,0)="481 SEQ #400^3090421.140707^17"
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,0)="^^28^28^3090421"
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,1,0)="This patch contains enhancements and modifications to the XUS NPI EXTRACT"
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,2,0)="REPORT [XUS NPI EXTRACT] option which is already loaded at the sites.  The"
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,3,0)="changes contained in this patch address the following:"
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,4,0)="  "
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,5,0)="1. With the installation of this patch, an approved Chief Business Office"
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,6,0)="   (CBO) staff member (with a valid network user identification and "
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,7,0)="   password), shall have the ability to remotely schedule the XUS NPI"
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,8,0)="   EXTRACT REPORT [XUS NPI EXTRACT] option to run at each selected site "
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,9,0)="   on a chosen date or dates. This new functionality will replace the"
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,10,0)="   currently scheduled Task Manager task (which was set up by site"
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,11,0)="   Information Resource Management (IRM) staff with the installation of"
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,12,0)="   patch XU*8.0*453) which automatically runs the extract every three"
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,13,0)="   months."
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,14,0)="   "
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,15,0)="2. This patch addresses an issue found with sites that did not choose to"
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,16,0)="   install the PSO*7.0*273 patch.  Any such sites were receiving a"
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,17,0)="   <NOROUTINE> error when attempting to run the extract (See Remedy Ticket"
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,18,0)="   217164 below). A solution has been included which will prevent this "
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,19,0)="   error from occurring."
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,20,0)="   "
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,21,0)="3. This patch also changes both the format of and the number of "
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,22,0)="   verification messages that get sent when the XUS NPI EXTRACT REPORT"
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,23,0)="   option [XUS NPI EXTRACT] is run.  Currently, a verification email"
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,24,0)="   message is sent to each member of the ""NPI EXTRACT VERIFICATION"" mail"
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,25,0)="   group for each extract mail message that is created.  With the"
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,26,0)="   installation of this patch, only one verification message will be"
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,27,0)="   created and sent to each member of the ""NPI EXTRACT VERIFICATION"" mail"
^DIC(9.4,3,22,21,"PAH",387,1,28,0)="   group."
