^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",25,1,26,0)="       Install Package(s)"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",25,1,27,0)="4.  MSM Sites - Answer YES to the question 'Want to MOVE routines to"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",25,1,28,0)="    other CPUs?'. Enter the names of your Compute and Print server(s)."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",25,1,29,0)="5.  AXP Sites, after patch has installed, rebuild your map set."
