^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",27,1,7,0)="Test Site:  Puget Sound HCS; Togus, ME; Bronx, NY"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",27,1,8,0)="This patch fixes a bug introduced in patch XM*7.1*46.  If a message had"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",27,1,9,0)="too many lines, too many responses, or too many recipients to copy, then"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",27,1,10,0)="routine ^XMA2C blew up with an undefined error.  This patch fixes this bug. "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",27,1,11,0)=""
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",27,1,12,0)="==========================================================================="
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",27,1,13,0)="This patch should be installed after hours, when user activity is at a"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",27,1,14,0)="minimum.  You should put the XMUSER Option out of order."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",27,1,15,0)="==========================================================================="
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",27,1,16,0)=""
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",27,1,17,0)="INSTALLATION:"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",27,1,18,0)="1.  DSM Sites: If any of these routines is mapped, disable mapping for the "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",27,1,19,0)="    affected routine(s).  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",27,1,20,0)="2.  On the PackMan menu, use the 'INSTALL/CHECK MESSAGE' option.  This loads "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",27,1,21,0)="    the patch into a Transport Global on your system.  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",27,1,22,0)="3.  On the KIDS:Installation menu, use the following options to install the "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",27,1,23,0)="    Transport Global: "
