^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,0)="^^41^41^2971127"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,1,0)="MailMan patch XM*7.1*54 contains the following bug fix:"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,2,0)=""
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,3,0)="NOIS:       BOS-1097-12284"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,4,0)="Rtn:        ^XMA3"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,5,0)="Test Site:  Boston, MA"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,6,0)="This patch fixes a bug introduced in patch XM*7.1*37.  During the init for the"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,7,0)="unreferenced message purge, it $ORDERs through one global, but gets its record"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,8,0)="from another global. This patch makes sure it gets its record from the same"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,9,0)="global it $ORDERs through."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,10,0)=""
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,11,0)="==========================================================================="
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,12,0)="This patch may be installed at any time."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,13,0)="==========================================================================="
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,14,0)=""
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,15,0)="INSTALLATION:"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,16,0)="1.  DSM Sites: If any of these routines is mapped, disable mapping for the "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,17,0)="    affected routine(s).  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,18,0)="2.  On the PackMan menu, use the 'INSTALL/CHECK MESSAGE' option.  This loads "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,19,0)="    the patch into a Transport Global on your system.  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,20,0)="3.  On the KIDS:Installation menu, use the following options to install the "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",28,1,21,0)="    Transport Global: "
