^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",49,1,5,0)="If a remote address contains a blank and a left parenthesis, it may be"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",49,1,6,0)="corrupted by the address checker provided with patch XM*7.1*50."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",49,1,7,0)="For example, the address ""G.LAB REPORTS(F)@domain"" becomes"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",49,1,8,0)="""REPORTS(F)@domain"".  This patch fixes this problem."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",49,1,9,0)=""
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",49,1,10,0)="NOTE: This patch should be installed after hours, when user activity is at a"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",49,1,11,0)="minimum.  It requires MailMan patch XM*7.1*50."
