^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",52,1,37,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",52,1,38,0)="INSTALLATION:"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",52,1,39,0)="NOTE: This patch should be installed after hours, when user activity is at a"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",52,1,40,0)="minimum.  It requires MailMan patch XM*7.1*50."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",52,1,41,0)="1.  DSM Sites: If any of these routines is mapped, disable mapping for the "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",52,1,42,0)="    affected routine(s).  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",52,1,43,0)="2.  On the PackMan menu, use the 'INSTALL/CHECK MESSAGE' option.  This loads "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",52,1,44,0)="    the patch into a Transport Global on your system.  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",52,1,45,0)="3.  You do not need to stop TaskMan or the background filers."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",52,1,46,0)="4.  On the KIDS:Installation menu, use the following options to install the"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",52,1,47,0)="    Transport Global:"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",52,1,48,0)="       Verify Checksums in Transport Global"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",52,1,49,0)="       Print Transport Global"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",52,1,50,0)="       Compare Transport Global to Current System"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",52,1,51,0)="       Backup a Transport Global"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",52,1,52,0)="       Install Package(s)"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",52,1,53,0)=" Select INSTALL NAME:    XM*7.1*75     Loaded from Distribution  <date/time>"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",52,1,54,0)="                         ========="
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",52,1,55,0)=" Want to DISABLE Scheduled Options, Menu Options, and Protocols? YES// NO"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",52,1,56,0)="                                                                       =="
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",52,1,57,0)="5.  DSM Sites: After patch has installed, rebuild your map set, if necessary."
