^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",55,1,6,0)="Option XMPOST may error out with an undefined XMDUZ.  This patch fixes that."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",55,1,7,0)=""
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",55,1,8,0)="NOTE: This patch should be installed after hours, when user activity is at a"
