^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",59,1,5,0)="Sometimes, when printing to P-MESSAGE device, MailMan aborts because the"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",59,1,6,0)="XMV variables (with user info) might not be properly set up.  This patch"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",59,1,7,0)="ensures that they are properly set up."
