^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",65,1,30,0)="INSTALLATION:"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",65,1,31,0)="NOTE: This patch should be installed after hours, when user activity is at a"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",65,1,32,0)="minimum.  It requires MailMan patch XM*7.1*83 and FileMan patch DI*22.0*1."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",65,1,33,0)="1.  DSM Sites: If any of these routines is mapped, disable mapping for the "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",65,1,34,0)="    affected routine(s).  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",65,1,35,0)="2.  On the PackMan menu, use the 'INSTALL/CHECK MESSAGE' option.  This loads "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",65,1,36,0)="    the patch into a Transport Global on your system.  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",65,1,37,0)="3.  You do not need to stop TaskMan or the background filers."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",65,1,38,0)="4.  On the KIDS:Installation menu, use the following options to install the"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",65,1,39,0)="    Transport Global:"
