^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",68,1,36,0)="1.  DSM Sites: If any of these routines is mapped, disable mapping for the "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",68,1,37,0)="    affected routine(s).  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",68,1,38,0)="2.  On the PackMan menu, use the 'INSTALL/CHECK MESSAGE' option.  This loads "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",68,1,39,0)="    the patch into a Transport Global on your system.  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",68,1,40,0)="3.  You do not need to stop TaskMan or the background filer."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",68,1,41,0)="4.  On the KIDS:Installation menu, use the following options to install the"
