^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",75,1,37,0)="3.  You do not need to stop TaskMan or the background filers."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",75,1,38,0)="4.  On the KIDS:Installation menu, use the following options to install the"
