^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",79,1,56,0)="1.  DSM Sites: If any of these routines is mapped, disable mapping for the "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",79,1,57,0)="    affected routine(s).  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",79,1,58,0)="2.  On the PackMan menu, use the 'INSTALL/CHECK MESSAGE' option.  This loads "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",79,1,59,0)="    the patch into a Transport Global on your system.  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",79,1,60,0)="3.  You do not need to stop TaskMan or the background filer."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",79,1,61,0)="4.  On the KIDS:Installation menu, use the following options to install the"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",79,1,62,0)="    Transport Global:"
