^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",80,1,22,0)="The second line of the routine now looks like:"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",80,1,23,0)="       ;;7.1;MailMan;**[patch list]**;Jun 02, 1994"
