^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",102,1,33,0)="    the patch into a Transport Global on your system.  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",102,1,34,0)="4.  You do not need to stop TaskMan or the background filer."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",102,1,35,0)="    Users may be on the system."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",102,1,36,0)="5.  On the KIDS:Installation menu, use the following options to install the"
