^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",142,1,32,0)="2.  DSM Sites: If any of these routines is mapped, disable mapping for the "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",142,1,33,0)="    affected routine(s).  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",142,1,34,0)="3.  On the PackMan menu, use the 'INSTALL/CHECK MESSAGE' option.  This loads "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",142,1,35,0)="    the patch into a Transport Global on your system.  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",142,1,36,0)="4.  You do not need to stop TaskMan or the Background Filer."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",142,1,37,0)="    Users may be on the system."
