^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",161,1,31,0)="NOTE: This patch should be installed during off hours, when user activity"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",161,1,32,0)="is at a minimum.  It requires MailMan patch XM*7.1*172."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",161,1,33,0)="1.  Users may be on the system during installation of this patch."
