^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",161,1,35,0)="    affected routine(s).  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",161,1,36,0)="3.  On the PackMan menu, use the 'INSTALL/CHECK MESSAGE' option.  This loads "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",161,1,37,0)="    the patch into a Transport Global on your system.  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",161,1,38,0)="4.  You do not need to stop TaskMan or the background filer."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",161,1,39,0)="    Users may be on the system."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",161,1,40,0)="5.  On the KIDS:Installation menu, use the following options to install the"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",161,1,41,0)="    Transport Global:"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",161,1,42,0)="       Verify Checksums in Transport Global"
