^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",166,1,63,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",166,1,64,0)="INSTALLATION:"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",166,1,65,0)="NOTE: This patch should be installed during off hours, when user activity"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",166,1,66,0)="is at a minimum.  It requires MailMan patches XM*7.1*159, *173, *179 & *182."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",166,1,67,0)="1.  Users may be on the system during installation of this patch."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",166,1,68,0)="2.  DSM Sites: If any of these routines is mapped, disable mapping for the "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",166,1,69,0)="    affected routine(s).  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",166,1,70,0)="3.  On the PackMan menu, use the 'INSTALL/CHECK MESSAGE' option.  This loads "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",166,1,71,0)="    the patch into a Transport Global on your system.  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",166,1,72,0)="4.  You do not need to stop TaskMan or the background filer."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",166,1,73,0)="    Users may be on the system."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",166,1,74,0)="5.  On the KIDS:Installation menu, use the following options to install the"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",166,1,75,0)="    Transport Global:"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",166,1,76,0)="       Verify Checksums in Transport Global"
