^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",169,1,55,0)="INSTALLATION:"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",169,1,56,0)="NOTE: This patch should be installed during off hours, when user activity is"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",169,1,57,0)="at a minimum.  It requires MailMan patches XM*7.1*155,*161,*170,*190 & *194."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",169,1,58,0)="1.  Users may be on the system during installation of this patch."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",169,1,59,0)="2.  DSM Sites: If any of these routines is mapped, disable mapping for the "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",169,1,60,0)="    affected routine(s).  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,1,"PAH",169,1,61,0)="3.  On the PackMan menu, use the 'INSTALL/CHECK MESSAGE' option.  This loads "
