^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",2,1,76,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",2,1,77,0)="INSTALLATION:"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",2,1,78,0)="NOTE: This patch should be installed during off hours, when user activity"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",2,1,79,0)="is at a minimum.  It has no patch prerequisites, except, of course, that"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",2,1,80,0)="MailMan 8.0 be installed.  Installation will take less than 1 minute."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",2,1,81,0)="1. Users may be on the system during installation of this patch."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",2,1,82,0)="2. DSM Sites: If any of these routines is mapped, disable mapping for the "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",2,1,83,0)="   affected routine(s).  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",2,1,84,0)="3. On the PackMan menu, use the 'INSTALL/CHECK MESSAGE' option.  This loads "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",2,1,85,0)="   the patch into a Transport Global on your system.  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",2,1,86,0)="4. Users may be on the system.  You do not need to stop TaskMan or the"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",2,1,87,0)="   background filer."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",2,1,88,0)="5. On the KIDS:Installation menu, use the following options to install the"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",2,1,89,0)="   Transport Global:"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",2,1,90,0)="       Verify Checksums in Transport Global"
