^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",9,1,34,0)="    the patch into a Transport Global on your system.  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",9,1,35,0)="4.  Users may be on the system.  You do not need to stop TaskMan"
