^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",10,1,6,0)="If you run OPTION: Historical Queue Data/Stats Report [XMQHIST] after you"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",10,1,7,0)="install Kernel patch XU*8.0*189, the default start date appears as a 5-digit"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",10,1,8,0)="number, instead of the current month and year. This patch fixes that."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",10,1,9,0)=""
