^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",16,1,33,0)="NOTE: This patch should be installed during off hours, when user activity"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",16,1,34,0)="is at a minimum.  It has no patch prerequisites, except that MailMan 8 must"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",16,1,35,0)="be installed."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",16,1,36,0)="1.  Users may be on the system during installation of this patch."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",16,1,37,0)="2.  DSM Sites: If any of these routines is mapped, disable mapping for the "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",16,1,38,0)="    affected routine(s).  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",16,1,39,0)="3.  On the PackMan menu, use the 'INSTALL/CHECK MESSAGE' option.  This loads "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",16,1,40,0)="    the patch into a Transport Global on your system.  "
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",16,1,41,0)="4.  Users may be on the system.  You do not need to stop TaskMan"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",16,1,42,0)="    or the background filer."
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",16,1,43,0)="5.  On the KIDS:Installation menu, use the following options to install the"
^DIC(9.4,4,22,2,"PAH",16,1,44,0)="    Transport Global:"
