^DIC(9.4,5,22,13,"PAH",29,1,37,0)="  3.  The patch has now been loaded into a Transport global on your"
^DIC(9.4,5,22,13,"PAH",29,1,38,0)="      system. You now need to use KIDS to install the Transport global."
^DIC(9.4,5,22,13,"PAH",29,1,39,0)="      On the KIDS menu, under the 'Installation' menu, use the following"
