^DIC(9.4,8,22,14,"PAH",92,1,1,0)="The purpose of this patch is to add code for the update that was posted "
^DIC(9.4,8,22,14,"PAH",92,1,2,0)="in the Federal Register for fiscal year 2023. These changes were published"
^DIC(9.4,8,22,14,"PAH",92,1,3,0)="on https://www.cms.gov and are part of the version 40 revision 1 release,"
^DIC(9.4,8,22,14,"PAH",92,1,4,0)="with an effective status of April 1, 2023."
