^DIC(9.4,9,22,3.3,"PAH",27,1,1,0)="LAB TEST ORDER AND DIET PATTERN RELATED UPDATES."
^DIC(9.4,9,22,3.3,"PAH",27,1,2,0)="Please see the detailed description of FH*5.0*30 on FORUM."
