^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,100,0)="Installation Instructions: "
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,101,0)="=========================="
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,102,0)="This patch can be installed with VISTA users online.  However, it is"
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,103,0)="recommended that it be Queued for a time of generally least activity."
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,104,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,105,0)="     1.  AXP sites: Review your mapped routine set.  If any of the"
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,106,0)="routine(s) listed in the ROUTINE SUMMARY section are mapped, they should"
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,107,0)="be removed from the mapped set at this time."
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,108,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,109,0)="     2.  Use the 'INSTALL/CHECK MESSAGE' option on the PackMan menu. This "
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,110,0)="option will load the KIDS package onto your system."
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,111,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,112,0)="     3.  The patch has now been loaded into a transport global on your"
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,113,0)="system. You now need to use KIDS to install the transport global."
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,114,0)="  "
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,115,0)="     4.  On the KIDS menu, under the 'Installation' menu, use the"
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,116,0)="following options:"
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,117,0)="            Print Transport Global "
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,118,0)="            Compare Transport Global to Current System "
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,119,0)="            Verify Checksums in Transport Global "
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,120,0)="            Backup a Transport Global"
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,121,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,122,0)="     5.  On the KIDS menu, under the 'Installation' menu, use the"
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,123,0)="following option:"
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,124,0)="            Select Installation Option: Install Package(s) "
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,125,0)="            Select INSTALL NAME: DI*21.0*53 "
^DIC(9.4,13,22,7,"PAH",31,1,126,0)="                                 =========="
