^DIC(9.4,13,22,9,"PAH",13,1,114,0)="===================="
^DIC(9.4,13,22,9,"PAH",13,1,115,0)="The second line of each of these routines now looks like:"
^DIC(9.4,13,22,9,"PAH",13,1,116,0)=" ;;22.2;VA FileMan;**[Patch List]**;Jan 05, 2016;Build 1"
^DIC(9.4,13,22,9,"PAH",13,1,117,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,13,22,9,"PAH",13,1,118,0)="The checksums below are new checksums, and"
^DIC(9.4,13,22,9,"PAH",13,1,119,0)=" can be checked with CHECK1^XTSUMBLD."
