^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",106,1,125,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",106,1,126,0)="The following is a list of routines included in patch LR*5.2*266. The"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",106,1,127,0)="second line of each routine now looks like:"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",106,1,128,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",106,1,129,0)="<tab>;;5.2;LAB SERVICE;**[patch list]**;Sep 27, 1994"
