^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",141,1,270,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",141,1,271,0)=" LR*5.2*313 Installed."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",141,1,272,0)="               Jan 26, 2004@11:26:28"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",141,1,273,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",141,1,274,0)=" Install Message sent #xxxxx"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",142,0)="312 SEQ #240^3040903^1"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",142,1,0)="^^1^1^3040903"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",142,1,1,0)="See patch description for details."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,0)="320 SEQ #241^3040917^1"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,0)="^^141^141^3040917"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,1,0)="EFFECT ON BLOOD BANK FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS: Patch LR*5.2*320 does not "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,2,0)="contain any changes to the VISTA BLOOD BANK Software as defined by VHA  "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,3,0)="DIRECTIVE 99-053 titled VISTA BLOOD BANK SOFTWARE VERSION 5.2."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,4,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,5,0)="EFFECT ON BLOOD BANK FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS: Patch LR*5.2*320 does not "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,6,0)="alter or modify any software design safeguards or safety critical"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,7,0)="elements functions."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,8,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,9,0)="RISK ANALYSIS: Changes made by patch LR*5.2*320 have no effect on Blood "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,10,0)="Bank software functionality, therefore RISK is none. "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,11,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,12,0)="VALIDATION REQUIREMENTS BY OPTION:  Because of the nature of the changes made,"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,13,0)="no specific validation requirements exist as a result of installation of this"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,14,0)="patch."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,15,0)="***********************************************************************"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,16,0)=""
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,17,0)="The EPI Historical Reseeding patch, LR*5.2*320, contains modifications to the"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,18,0)="Emerging Pathogens Initiative (EPI) software that corrects fata errors received"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,19,0)="during the historical reseeding of the EPI data.  Sites were receiving fatal"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,20,0)="errors from Austin that caused their data to be rejected."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,21,0)="The modifications included in this patch are:"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,22,0)=""
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,23,0)="1) Test patients are not included in the EPI data sent to Austin."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,24,0)=""
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,25,0)="2) A string length error was fixed, MERGEOUT+34^HLTF2:1,%DSM-E-STRLEN.  This"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,26,0)=" error was due to PID segments that were over 245 characters long."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,27,0)=""
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,28,0)="3) The 410 errors, discharge date after processing date, was corrected.  This"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,29,0)=" problem was due to patients with a future discharge date.  This patch resolves"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,30,0)=" this problem by not sending the discharge date to Austin if the discharge date"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,31,0)=" is greater than the last day of the month of the extracted data."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,32,0)=""
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,33,0)="4) An undefined error is fixed.  In the Print Detailed Verification Report "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,34,0)="[LREPI VERIFICATION REPORT] option an undefined error occurs when an ""^"" is "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,35,0)="entered at the ""Select Pathogen: "" prompt.  Also, when selecting the Detailed"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,36,0)="Verification Report, the processing period is now displayed for easier"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,37,0)="selection."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,38,0)=""
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,39,0)="5) The 605 errors are corrected.  This problem was due to a missing date in the"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,40,0)=" BACT RPT DATE APPROVED (#11 ) field of MICROBIOLOGY (#63.05) subfile of LAB "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,41,0)=" DATA (#63) file for organism IDs and a ""0"" was being sent to Austin.  This"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,42,0)=" patch resolves this problem by sending a blank field when the completed date"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,43,0)=" is missing instead of ""0""."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,44,0)=""
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,45,0)="6) A processing routine is added to the LREPI CLIENT protocol.  This resolves"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,46,0)="missing processing routine HL7 errors."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,47,0)=""
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,48,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,49,0)="Test Sites:"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,50,0)="=============="
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,51,0)=" Phoenix, AZ VAMC"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,52,0)=" Boston, MA HCS"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,53,0)=" Cincinnati, OH VAMC"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,54,0)=" Durham, NC VAMC"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",143,1,55,0)=""
