^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,68,0)="   LR326            N/A           2022894   326"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,69,0)="   LRCAPDAR        7334799        7585446   143,169,258,307,326  "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,70,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,71,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,72,0)="INSTALLATION INSTRUCTIONS"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,73,0)="========================="
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,74,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,75,0)="The install time for this patch is less than 5 minutes.  This patch can "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,76,0)="be installed when Laboratory users are on the system. Suggested time to "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,77,0)="install: non-peak requirements hours."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,78,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,79,0)="NOTE: Patch LR*5.2*307 must be installed BEFORE this patch."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,80,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,81,0)="1. If LRCAPDAR is mapped, disable mapping for it."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,82,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,83,0)="2. Use the 'INSTALL/CHECK MESSAGE' option of the PackMan menu."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,84,0)="   this option will load the KIDS patch onto your system."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,85,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,86,0)="3. From the 'Kernal Installation & Distribution System' (KIDS)"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,87,0)="   menu, select the 'Installation Menu'"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,88,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,89,0)="4. Use the 'Verify Checksum in Tranport Global' option to"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,90,0)="   confirm that the correct checksums are present."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,91,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,92,0)="5. From the same menu select each of the following options:"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,93,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,94,0)="   'Compare Transport Global to Current System'"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,95,0)="   'Backup Transport Global'"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,96,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,97,0)="6. From the 'Installation Menu' of the KIDS menu, run the"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,98,0)="   option 'Install Package(s)'.  Select the package 'LR*5.2*326'"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,99,0)="   and proceed with the installation."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,100,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,101,0)="7. For each of the installation questions answer 'NO'."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,102,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,103,0)="8. If you unmapped the routine in step 1, rebuild your map set."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,104,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,105,0)="9. Routine LR326 will be deleted after a successful patch installation."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,106,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,107,0)="Installation Example"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,108,0)="===================="
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",148,1,109,0)=" "
