^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,428,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,429,0)="Installation Instructions:  "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,430,0)="========================= "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,431,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,432,0)="The patch LR*5.2*302 KIDS build file named LR52_302.KID stored in the "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,433,0)="ASCII format can be obtained from the following Office of Information "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,434,0)="Field Offices (OIFOs) ANONYMOUS SOFTWARE directories"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,435,0)="OIFO         FTP Address                Directory"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,436,0)="Albany       ftp.fo-albany.domain.ext   anonymous.software "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,437,0)="Hines        ftp.fo-hines.domain.ext    anonymous.software"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,438,0)="Salt Lake    ftp.fo-slc.domain.ext      anonymous.software"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,439,0)="  "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,440,0)="All users may remain on the system. Installation time is less than 30 "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,441,0)="minutes."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,442,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,443,0)="Note: The patch should be installed during off peak hours."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,444,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,445,0)="No laboratory background jobs need to be stopped. No options need to be "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,446,0)="placed out of service."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,447,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,448,0)="LABORATORY USERS MUST NOT ACCESSION SPECIMENS OR ENTER/VERIFY RESULTS "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,449,0)="DURING THE INSTALLATION because several reference files are being deleted "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,450,0)="and replaced with this patch."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,451,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,452,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,453,0)="============================                           "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,454,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,455,0)="From the Kernel Installation & Distribution System (KIDS) menu "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,456,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,457,0)="         1. Use the 'Load a Distribution' option to load the "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,458,0)="            LR_52_302.KID file onto your system."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,459,0)="         2. The patch has now been loaded into a Transport global"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,460,0)="            on your system. You now need to use KIDS to install"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,461,0)="            the Transport global."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,462,0)="            On the KIDS menu, under the 'Installation' menu, use "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,463,0)="            the following options:"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,464,0)="                Print Transport Global"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,465,0)="                Compare Transport Global to Current System"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,466,0)="                Verify Checksums in Transport Global"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,467,0)="                Backup a Transport Global"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,468,0)="         3. Users may remain on the system, but installation "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,469,0)="            should be done at off peak hours."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,470,0)="         4. Installation time is less than 30 minutes during off "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,471,0)="            peak hours and less than 45 minutes during peak hours."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,472,0)="         5. Installation of this patch requires no additional "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,473,0)="            memory space."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,474,0)="         6. From the 'Installation Menu' of the KIDS menu, run the "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,475,0)="            option"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,476,0)="            'Install Package(s)' Select the package 'LR*5.2*302' "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,477,0)="            and proceed with the install."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,478,0)="         7. When prompted 'Want KIDS to INHIBIT LOGONS during the"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,479,0)="            install? YES//' respond NO."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,480,0)="         8. When prompted 'Want to DISABLE scheduled Options, Menu"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,481,0)="            Options, and Protocols? YES//' respond NO."
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,482,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,483,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,484,0)="================"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,485,0)="Example of install:"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,486,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,487,0)=" Select Installation Option: LOAD a Distribution"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,488,0)="Enter a Host File: LR_52_302.KID"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,489,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,490,0)="KIDS Distribution saved on Dec 09, 2004@04:27:46"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,491,0)="Comment: NLT/LOINC v2.13 Update"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",152,1,492,0)=" "
