^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",209,1,57,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",209,1,58,0)="Although the software installation will be phased, the documentation will "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",209,1,59,0)="be available for the entire VBECS package on the ANONYMOUS.SOFTWRE "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",209,1,60,0)="directory or at one of the following Office of Information (OI) Field "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",209,1,61,0)="Offices. Sites may retrieve documentation either the "".PDF"" or ""DOC"" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",209,1,62,0)="format in one of the following ways:"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",209,1,63,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",209,1,64,0)="1.      The preferred method is to FTP the files from : "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",209,1,65,0)="Download.vista.domain.ext"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",209,1,66,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",209,1,67,0)="2.      Sites may also elect to retrieve documentation directly from a "
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",209,1,68,0)="specific server as follows:"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",209,1,69,0)="       Albany                  ftp.fo-albany.domain.ext"
^DIC(9.4,14,22,5.9,"PAH",209,1,70,0)="       Hines                   ftp.fo-hines.domain.ext"
