^DIC(9.4,28,22,6,"PAH",4,1,21,0)="each routine will look like:"
^DIC(9.4,28,22,6,"PAH",4,1,22,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,28,22,6,"PAH",4,1,23,0)="            <tab>;;2.0;GCS;**[Patch List}**;Mar 14, 1995"
