^DIC(9.4,33,0)="HEALTH LEVEL SEVEN^HL^DHCP IMPLEMENTATION OF HEALTH LEVEL SEVEN"
^DIC(9.4,33,1,0)="^^4^4^2950710^^^^"
^DIC(9.4,33,1,1,0)="This package is a generic implementation the Health Level Seven (HL7)"
^DIC(9.4,33,1,2,0)="protocol for use by all DHCP applications.  The HL7 protocol provides a"
^DIC(9.4,33,1,3,0)="single, standard interface between computer systems for the exchange of"
^DIC(9.4,33,1,4,0)="clinical information."
