^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,46,0)="NOTE: This patch should be installed during off hours, when activity is at"
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,47,0)="a minimum.  It requires HL7 patch HL*1.6*66."
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,48,0)="1. Users may be on the system during the installation of this patch."
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,49,0)="2. DSM Sites: If any of these routines is mapped, disable mapping for the"
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,50,0)="   affected routine(s)."
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,51,0)="3. Shutdown all Logical Links and incoming and outgoing filers, and"
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,52,0)="   the Link Manager. Use the options:"
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,53,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,54,0)="     Filer and Link Management Options -> "
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,55,0)="         SA     Stop All Messaging Background Processes"
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,56,0)="         LM     TCP/IP Link Manager Start/Stop"
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,57,0)=""
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,58,0)="4. DSM sites: Disable all HL7 UCX Services for this installation."
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,59,0)="5. Use the 'INSTALL/CHECK MESSAGE' option on the PackMan menu to load the"
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,60,0)="   KIDS package into a Transport global on your system.  "
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,61,0)="6. On the KIDS:Installation menu, use the following options to install the"
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,62,0)="   Transport Global:"
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,63,0)="         2 Verify Checksums in Transport Global "
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,64,0)="         3 Print Transport Global "
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,65,0)="         4 Compare Transport Global to Current System "
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,66,0)="         5 Backup a Transport Global "
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,67,0)="         6 Install Package(s) "
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,68,0)=" Select INSTALL NAME: HL*1.6*68     Loaded from Distribution  <date/time>"
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,69,0)="                      ========="
^DIC(9.4,33,22,1.4,"PAH",45,1,70,0)=" Install Questions for HL*1.6*68"
