^DIC(9.4,35,22,3,"PAH",100,1,5,0)="of this patch.  In addition, you may want to review consult"
^DIC(9.4,35,22,3,"PAH",100,1,6,0)="patches GMRC*3*15 and GMRC*3*18, which are also required to see"
