^DIC(9.4,47,22,5.9,"PAH",569,1,3,0)="instead of referencing the global for appointment data retrieval. "
^DIC(9.4,47,22,5.9,"PAH",569,1,4,0)="This patch also addresses the error handling when an error occurs."
