^DIC(9.4,47,22,5.9,"PAH",889,1,1,0)="The purpose of this patch is to add missing Name Component records in the "
^DIC(9.4,47,22,5.9,"PAH",889,1,2,0)="PATIENT file #2 , and the NAME COMPONENTS (file #20). The missing name "
