^DIC(9.4,48,22,5.28,"PAH",61,0)="110 SEQ #99^2970423^1"
^DIC(9.4,48,22,5.28,"PAH",61,1,0)="^^6^6^2970423"
^DIC(9.4,48,22,5.28,"PAH",61,1,1,0)="This patch corrects three problems: 1) Corrects the patient classification"
^DIC(9.4,48,22,5.28,"PAH",61,1,2,0)="questions in check-out to use the API calls to determine whether to ask"
^DIC(9.4,48,22,5.28,"PAH",61,1,3,0)="or not, instead of hitting the patient file; 2) The comparison of PCE "
^DIC(9.4,48,22,5.28,"PAH",61,1,4,0)="with SD data during inpatient appoinment checkouts is skipped; 3) This"
^DIC(9.4,48,22,5.28,"PAH",61,1,5,0)="patch also includes modifications to SCDXFU02-03 to prevent the creation"
^DIC(9.4,48,22,5.28,"PAH",61,1,6,0)="of orphan entries in the Deleted Outpatient Encounter file."
