^DIC(9.4,48,22,5.28,"PAH",214,1,5,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,48,22,5.28,"PAH",214,1,6,0)="Added New type crossrefence to POSTION ASSIGNMENT HISTORY (#404.52) and "
