^DIC(9.4,48,22,5.28,"PAH",328,1,1,0)="This patch will allow keeping the wait list entry status up to date with "
^DIC(9.4,48,22,5.28,"PAH",328,1,2,0)="any related appointment cancellation by clinic, performed either for a "
^DIC(9.4,48,22,5.28,"PAH",328,1,3,0)="patient or for a clinic. The related EWL entries will be opened following "
