^DIC(9.4,48,22,5.28,"PAH",560,1,2,0)="STOP (#40.7) file as requested by the Office of Finance, Managerial Cost "
^DIC(9.4,48,22,5.28,"PAH",560,1,3,0)="Accounting Office (MCAO)."
