^DIC(9.4,48,22,5.28,"PAH",671,1,12,0)="VSE-8079: BF - VistA: Update Patient Search RPC to return -1 to 4"
^DIC(9.4,48,22,5.28,"PAH",671,1,13,0)="VSE-8080: TB - VistA: Modify create appointment RPCs to change the"
