^DIC(9.4,48,22,5.28,"PAH",674,1,31,0)="VSE-7967: JJ - VistA: Add an ""Other"" option to the preference file"
^DIC(9.4,48,22,5.28,"PAH",674,1,32,0)="VSE-8038: FF - VS GUI: Determine if veteran has successfully participated "
