^DIC(9.4,48,22,5.28,"PAH",713,1,39,0)="VSE-11148: GW - VistA: Modify SDES2 QUERY APPT REQUESTS to fix an issue "
^DIC(9.4,48,22,5.28,"PAH",713,1,40,0)="                where the query returns more records than requested."
