^DIC(9.4,49,22,10,"PAH",578,1,4,0)="Former Service Members whose Primary Eligibility changed from EXPANDED MH"
^DIC(9.4,49,22,10,"PAH",578,1,5,0)="CARE NON-ENROLLEE to a new Primary Eligibility with a VERIFIED eligibility"
^DIC(9.4,49,22,10,"PAH",578,1,6,0)="status. These patients are no longer treated under the Other Than"
^DIC(9.4,49,22,10,"PAH",578,1,7,0)="Honorable (OTH) authority (VHA Directive 1601A.02)."
