^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",98,1,15,0)="the VA PRODUCT file (#50.68) to the proper PMIs."
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",98,1,16,0)="The source of the data for the PMIs is First Data Bank."
