^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",113,1,2,0)="This patch provides updates to data in several of the files associated"
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",113,1,3,0)="with the Patient Medication Instruction Sheet (PMI) portion of the"
