^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",113,1,12,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",113,1,13,0)="The environment check routine for this patch checks to see that the"
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",113,1,14,0)="installer is a valid user."
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",113,1,15,0)="The post-install routine for this patch deletes existing entries in these"
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",113,1,16,0)="files, loads the new data, and rematches entries in the VA PRODUCT file "
