^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",143,1,4,0)="This patch generates four mail messages.  All are sent from NDF MANAGER"
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",143,1,5,0)="to members of the NDF DATA mail group, holders of the PSNMGR security "
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",143,1,6,0)="key, and the person installing the patch.  The first message, with the"
