^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",152,1,2,0)="Under some circumstances inactivation dates for entries in the DRUG"
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",152,1,3,0)="INGREDIENTS file (#50.416) were not being transmitted to the field.  This"
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",152,1,4,0)="patch updates entries in those fields with the proper inactivation dates."
