^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",164,1,1,0)="This patch will fix an issue where the Local Formulary Report"
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",164,1,2,0)="cannot be sent to a spooled device.  "
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",164,1,3,0)="It will also fix the NDF option of the Inquire to National "
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",164,1,4,0)="File so it displays Exclude Drg-Drg Interaction Ck."
