^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",201,1,2,0)="This patch provides updates to data in several of the files associated"
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",201,1,3,0)="with the National Drug File (NDF) application."
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",201,1,4,0)="This patch generates four mail messages.  All are sent from NDF MANAGER"
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",201,1,5,0)="to members of the NDF DATA mail group, holders of the PSNMGR security "
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",201,1,6,0)="key, and the person installing the patch.  The first message, with the"
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",201,1,7,0)="subject DATA UPDATE FOR NDF, lists new products, CMOP ID (if one exists),"
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",201,1,8,0)="dispense units, and associated NDCs, products for which the national"
