^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",201,1,12,0)="interactions that have been added, edited, or inactivated. The third, with"
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",201,1,13,0)="the subject DRUGS UNMATCHED FROM NATIONAL DRUG FILE, lists entries in the"
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",201,1,14,0)="DRUG file (#50) which have been unmatched from NDF.  The fourth, with the"
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",201,1,15,0)="subject INTERACTIONS and ALLERGIES UPDATED, lists interactions and allergies"
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",201,1,16,0)="which have been changed because they were created with ingredients that"
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",201,1,17,0)="are no longer primary ingredients."
