^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",276,1,11,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",276,1,12,0)="The environment check routine for this patch checks to see that the"
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",276,1,13,0)="installer is a valid user."
