^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",509,1,7,0)="dispense units, and associated NDCs, products for which the national"
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",509,1,8,0)="formulary indicator has changed, products that have been unmatched from"
^DIC(9.4,59,22,5,"PAH",509,1,9,0)="CMOP, and products for which the national formulary restriction has"
