^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",414,1,156,0)="Software being released as a host file and/or documentation describingthe "
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",414,1,157,0)="new functionality introduced by these patches are available."
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",414,1,158,0)="  The preferred method is to retrieve files from "
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",414,1,159,0)="download.vista.domain.ext."
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",414,1,160,0)="This transmits the files from the first available server. Sites may "
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",414,1,161,0)="also elect to retrieve files directly from a specific server. "
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",414,1,162,0)="  "
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",414,1,163,0)="Sites may retrieve the software and/or documentation directly using "
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",414,1,164,0)="Secure File Transfer Protocol (SFTP) from the ANONYMOUS.SOFTWARE "
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",414,1,165,0)="directory at the following OI Field Offices:"
