^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",618,1,1,0)="This patch distributes the Remote Procedure Call (RPC), routine, and"
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",618,1,2,0)="component updates that facilitate temporary and mailing address changes"
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",618,1,3,0)="to the PATIENT FILE (#2). These components support the VA Health Connect"
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",618,1,4,0)="Customer Relations Management (VAHC CRM) pharmacy project."
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",618,1,5,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",618,1,6,0)="The RPC's provide functionality to retrieve and update the temporary and "
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",618,1,7,0)="mailing addresses. The RPC's also provide the functionality to delete the"
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",618,1,8,0)="temporary address and update the TEMPORARY ADDRESS ACTIVE? (FILE "
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",618,1,9,0)="#2,.12105)"
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",618,1,10,0)="flag."
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",618,1,11,0)="The patch also removes the now defunct RPC's PSO GET TEMPORARY ADDRESS and"
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",618,1,12,0)="PSO TEMP ADDRESS UPDATE which have been superseded by PSO GET ADDRESS and"
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",618,1,13,0)="PSO ADDRESS UPDATE respectively."
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",618,1,14,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",618,1,15,0)=" "
