^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",625,1,1,0)="The Inbound Electronic Prescribing (eRx) Phase 3 Enhancements delivered in"
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",625,1,2,0)="this patch is a continuation effort to convert all of the MbM Class 3"
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",625,1,3,0)="modifications into Class 1. Below is a summary of the changes being"
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",625,1,4,0)="delivered in this patch. For a more comprehensive description of the changes"
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",625,1,5,0)="please refer to the documents listed in the Documentation section of this"
^DIC(9.4,60,22,13,"PAH",625,1,6,0)="description."
