^DIC(9.4,73,22,9,"PAH",17,1,53,0)="  "
^DIC(9.4,73,22,9,"PAH",17,1,54,0)="   1. Users ARE allowed to be on the system during the installation."
^DIC(9.4,73,22,9,"PAH",17,1,55,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,73,22,9,"PAH",17,1,56,0)="   2. DSM/AXP sites: Review your mapped routine set.  If any of the"
^DIC(9.4,73,22,9,"PAH",17,1,57,0)="      routines in the Routine Summary section are mapped, disable"
^DIC(9.4,73,22,9,"PAH",17,1,58,0)="      mapping for the affected routine."
^DIC(9.4,73,22,9,"PAH",17,1,59,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,73,22,9,"PAH",17,1,60,0)="   3. Use the ""INSTALL/CHECK MESSAGE"" option on the PackMan menu."
^DIC(9.4,73,22,9,"PAH",17,1,61,0)="      This loads the patch into a Transport Global onto your system."
^DIC(9.4,73,22,9,"PAH",17,1,62,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,73,22,9,"PAH",17,1,63,0)="   4. You DO NOT need to stop TaskMan or the background filers."
^DIC(9.4,73,22,9,"PAH",17,1,64,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,73,22,9,"PAH",17,1,65,0)="   5. On the KIDS menu, select the ""Installation"" menu and use the"
^DIC(9.4,73,22,9,"PAH",17,1,66,0)="      following options to install the Transport Global:"
