^DIC(9.4,81,22,2.3,"PAH",4,1,48,0)="          backup any other changes such as DDs or templates.  "
^DIC(9.4,81,22,2.3,"PAH",4,1,49,0)="      b.  Compare Transport Global to Current System  - this option will "
^DIC(9.4,81,22,2.3,"PAH",4,1,50,0)="          allow you to view all changes that will be made when the patch "
