^DIC(9.4,81,22,2.3,"PAH",4,1,53,0)="      c.  Verify Checksums in Transport Global - this option will "
^DIC(9.4,81,22,2.3,"PAH",4,1,54,0)="          allow you to ensure the integrity of the routines that are in "
