^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,36,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,37,0)="Installation Instruction:"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,38,0)="========================"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,39,0)="1. This patch can be loaded with users on the system."
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,40,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,41,0)="2. Routine mapping is NOT recommended for these routines.  If you are"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,42,0)="using routine mapping, review your mapped set and ensure that these"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,43,0)="routines are NOT in your mapped routine before proceeding and rebuild"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,44,0)="your map set afterward before reactivating TaskMan."
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,45,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,46,0)="3. Use the ""INSTALL/CHECK MESSAGE"" option on the PackMan menu.  This"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,47,0)="will load the KIDS package into your system."
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,48,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,49,0)="4. The patch has now been loaded into a transport global and you will"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,50,0)="use KIDS to install the transport global.  On the KIDS menu, under the"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,51,0)="'Installation' menu, use the following options"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,52,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,53,0)="   2 Verify Checksums in Transport Global"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,54,0)="   3 Print Transport Global"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,55,0)="   4 Compare Transport Global to Current System"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,56,0)="   5 Backup a Transport Global"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,57,0)="   6 Install Package(s)"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,58,0)="             INSTALL NAME:  VAQ*1.5*26"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,59,0)="                            =========="
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,60,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,61,0)="  Want KIDS to INHIBIT LOGONs during the install? YES// NO"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,62,0)="                                                        =="
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,63,0)="  Want to DISABLE Scheduled Options, Menu Options, and Protocols? NO"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,64,0)="                                                                  =="
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",2,1,65,0)=" "
