^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",6,1,47,0)="3.  On the PackMan menu, use the 'INSTALL/CHECK MESSAGE' option."
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",6,1,48,0)="    This loads the patch into a Transport Global on your system.  "
