^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",8,1,53,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",8,1,54,0)="INSTALLATION:"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",8,1,55,0)="NOTE: This patch should be installed during off hours, when user activity"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",8,1,56,0)="is at a minimum.  It requires patch VAQ*1.5*30."
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",8,1,57,0)="1.  Users may be on the system during installation of this patch."
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",8,1,58,0)="2.  DSM Sites: If any of these routines is mapped, disable mapping for the"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",8,1,59,0)="    affected routine(s).  "
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",8,1,60,0)="3.  On the PackMan menu, use the 'INSTALL/CHECK MESSAGE' option."
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",8,1,61,0)="    This loads the patch into a Transport Global on your system.  "
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",8,1,62,0)="4.  You do not need to stop TaskMan or the background filer."
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",8,1,63,0)="    Users may be on the system."
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",8,1,64,0)="5.  On the KIDS:Installation menu, use the following options to install"
