^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,29,0)="This patch introduces no new routines."
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,30,0)="=========================================================================="
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,31,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,32,0)="INSTALLATION:"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,33,0)="NOTE: This patch should be installed during off hours, when user activity"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,34,0)="is at a minimum.  It requires patch VAQ*1.5*29."
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,35,0)="1.  Users may be on the system during installation of this patch."
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,36,0)="2.  DSM Sites: If any of these routines is mapped, disable mapping for the"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,37,0)="    affected routine(s).  "
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,38,0)="3.  On the PackMan menu, use the 'INSTALL/CHECK MESSAGE' option."
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,39,0)="    This loads the patch into a Transport Global on your system.  "
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,40,0)="4.  You do not need to stop TaskMan or the background filer."
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,41,0)="    Users may be on the system."
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,42,0)="5.  On the KIDS:Installation menu, use the following options to install"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,43,0)="    the Transport Global."
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,44,0)="       Verify Checksums in Transport Global"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,45,0)="       Print Transport Global"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,46,0)="       Compare Transport Global to Current System"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,47,0)="       Backup a Transport Global"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,48,0)="       Install Package(s)"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,49,0)=" Select INSTALL NAME:   VAQ*1.5*35   Loaded from Distribution <date/time>"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,50,0)="                        =========="
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",10,1,51,0)=" Install Questions:"
