^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",11,1,6,0)="If two (or more) PDX patients share the same first initial of the last name"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",11,1,7,0)="and the same last 4 digits of the SSN, PDX will only show the first patient"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",11,1,8,0)="when attempting to Load/Edit PDX Transactions based on patient name."
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",11,1,9,0)="This patch fixes that."
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",11,1,10,0)=""
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",11,1,11,0)="NOTE: This patch should be installed during off hours, when user activity"
