^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",12,1,6,0)="Patch VAQ*1.5*30 caused some corrupted .01 fields in file 394.62.  Patch"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",12,1,7,0)="VAQ*1.5*34 stopped further corruption.  (Please see the description in"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",12,1,8,0)="patch VAQ*1.5*34 for an explanation of the corruption.)  The corruption"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",12,1,9,0)="cannot be undone, but it can be ignored.  This patch ensures that the"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",12,1,10,0)="corrupted .01 fields will not adversely affect NHE or any its data."
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",12,1,11,0)=""
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",12,1,12,0)="NOTE: This patch should be installed during off hours, when user activity"
^DIC(9.4,85,22,1.5,"PAH",12,1,13,0)="is at a minimum.  It requires patch VAQ*1.5*34."
