^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",182,1,2,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",182,1,3,0)="Warning:  Installing this backup patch message will install older versions"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",182,1,4,0)="of routines and Build Components (options, protocols, templates, etc.)."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",182,1,5,0)="Please verify with the Development Team that it is safe to install."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",183,0)="229 SEQ #196^3210518.105344^17"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",183,1,0)="^^7^7^3210518"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",183,1,1,0)="DVBA C PROCESS MAIL MESSAGE files an outdated value of ""NT"" into the "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",183,1,2,0)="REQUEST STATUS (#18) field of the 2507 REQUEST (#396.3) file, instead of "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",183,1,3,0)="looking up and filing a value which corresponds with ""NT"". Routine "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",183,1,4,0)="REQEDIT^DVBCXFRC has been edited so that instead of hard stuffing the "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",183,1,5,0)="value ""NT"" into the REQUEST STATUS (#18) field of the 2507 REQUEST "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",183,1,6,0)="(#396.3) file, it will allow FileMan to determine and fill the "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",183,1,7,0)="appropriate value that corresponds with ""NT""."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",184,0)="226b^3210702"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",184,1,0)="^^5^5^3210702"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",184,1,1,0)="Backup of DVBA*2.7*226 on Jul 02, 2021"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",184,1,2,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",184,1,3,0)="Warning:  Installing this backup patch message will install older versions"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",184,1,4,0)="of routines and Build Components (options, protocols, templates, etc.)."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",184,1,5,0)="Please verify with the Development Team that it is safe to install."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,0)="226 SEQ #197^3210702.142802^17"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,0)="^^24^24^3210702"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,1,0)="Patch DVBA*2.7*226 will update the Compensation and Pension"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,2,0)="Record Interchange (CAPRI) GUI Report Builder option. This option is used "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,3,0)="to create a report of a selection of Clinical Documents.  Processing for"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,4,0)="this option is being removed from the GUI and moved to the Vista server.  "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,5,0)="This move will minimize the resources used on the local machine and"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,6,0)="optimize the workflow, thus correcting the issue of CAPRI"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,7,0)="not responding and requiring the user to end task via Task Manager."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,8,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,9,0)="Patch DVBA*2.7*226 is also allowing for Disability Benefit "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,10,0)="Questionnaire's (DBQ's) to verify that the template being used is an"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,11,0)="active DBQ template before allowing completion and processing."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,12,0)="If the template is inactive, the DBQ is being marked ""Outdated Template"" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,13,0)="and the user is prompted to update the template for completion. This "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,14,0)="change is also reflected in a status addition to the CAPRI TEMPLATES File "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,15,0)="(#396.17) REVIEW STATUS Field (#11) having the term ""OUTDATED TEMPLATE"" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,16,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,17,0)="Patch DVBA*2.7*226 is modifying the DBQ Schema in preparation for the "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,18,0)="release of IEPD Claims-2.1."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,19,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,20,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,21,0)="Patch DVBA*2.7*226 will also fix the following issues:"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,22,0)="INC11416760 - CAPRI: Application Exception error"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,23,0)="INC13803597 - Change Joint Legacy Viewer tab in CAPRI to Joint "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",185,1,24,0)="              Longitudinal Viewer tab due to senior leadership re-branding"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",186,0)="234b^3210818"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",186,1,0)="^^5^5^3210818"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",186,1,1,0)="Backup of DVBA*2.7*234 on Aug 18, 2021"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",186,1,2,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",186,1,3,0)="Warning:  Installing this backup patch message will install older versions"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",186,1,4,0)="of routines and Build Components (options, protocols, templates, etc.)."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",186,1,5,0)="Please verify with the Development Team that it is safe to install."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",187,0)="234 SEQ #198^3210818.093017^17"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",187,1,0)="^^5^5^3210818"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",187,1,1,0)="This patch addresses a request to add the option First Party Veteran"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",187,1,2,0)="Charge Report [PRCA FP VETERAN CHRG RPT] to the HRC First Party Extended"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",187,1,3,0)="Services [DVBA HRC MENU EXTENDED SVCS], HRC Pharmacy Customer Care Menu"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",187,1,4,0)="[DVBA HRC MENU PHARMACY CC], and HRC Pharmacy Menu [DVBA HRC MENU"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",187,1,5,0)="PHARMACY]."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,0)="227 SEQ #199^3211021.151811^17"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,0)="^^31^31^3211021"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,1,0)="Patch DVBA*2.7*227 is using code originally introduced in patch "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,2,0)="DVBA*2.7*193 the system will allow the user to re-route a Compensation &"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,3,0)="Pension (C&P) exam request to any active C&P facility within the VA so"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,4,0)="that the request does not have to be cancelled and re-initiated."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,5,0)="CAPRI users will now have the ability to re-route an existing exam "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,6,0)="request."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,7,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,8,0)="Patch DVBA*2.7*227 also changes the location of the stored file for "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,9,0)="the News Server.  There is no functionality changes on the user side for"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,10,0)="this change. "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,11,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,12,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,13,0)="In response to requests to decouple routing locations between C&P Exam "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,14,0)="Requests and 7131 (release of information) Requests along with the "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,15,0)="ability to disable 2507 and/or 7131 Requests from being requested at "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,16,0)="certain sites, modifications were made to the ""Edit Exam List "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,17,0)="Parameters"" form/option to add functionality to control these new "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,18,0)="features.   Users with the necessary keys to access the form will "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,19,0)="now have the ability to maintain routing locations for C&P Exam Requests"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,20,0)="and 7131 (release of information) Requests independently.  "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,21,0)="DVBA*2.7*227 also introduces functionality that will allow facilities "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,22,0)="to disable the ability to submit C&P Exam Request and/or 7131 Requests"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,23,0)="by disabling the ""Add a New Request"" button specific to each of those "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,24,0)="requests."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,25,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,26,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,27,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,28,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,29,0)="Patch DVBA*2.7*227 will also fix the following issues:"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,30,0)="1. INC09160447 - CAPRI Report Builder is unable to print large reports."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",188,1,31,0)="2. INC18799389 - <PARAMETER>CHECK^DVBAB1B  - DEV"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",189,0)="236 SEQ #200^3220103.124226^17"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",189,1,0)="^^3^3^3220103"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",189,1,1,0)="Patch DVBA*2.7*236 will fix the following issue:"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",189,1,2,0)="This patch updates the AMIE EXAM (#396.6) file by changing the STATUS "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",189,1,3,0)="(#.5) field of exam DBQ GU Prostate cancer from ACTIVE to INACTIVE."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",190,0)="237 SEQ #201^3220106.084538^17"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",190,1,0)="^^16^16^3220106"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",190,1,1,0)="Patch DVBA*2.7*237 is addressing error handling for communication between "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",190,1,2,0)="CAPRI and Veterans Benefits Management System (VBMS)."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",190,1,3,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",190,1,4,0)="The CAPRI GUI will present a new error message for Clinical Document "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",190,1,5,0)="transmission failures and allowing users to retry the document"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",190,1,6,0)="transmission."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",190,1,7,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",190,1,8,0)="Three new status' in File ^DVB(396.17) CAPRI TEMPLATE file are being "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",190,1,9,0)="introduced. These new statuses are: Permanent Failure, Transmission Error"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",190,1,10,0)="and Signed.  These new status' will provide a clearer, documented status"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",190,1,11,0)="for transmission errors of the Disability Benefit Questionnaire (DBQ) to"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",190,1,12,0)="the Veterans Benefits Management System (VBMS)."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",190,1,13,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",190,1,14,0)="Patch DVBA*2.7*237 is adding the new status' for use in the Template "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",190,1,15,0)="Report that user's can select using the Compensation and Pension Record"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",190,1,16,0)="Interchange (CAPRI) GUI."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,0)="240 SEQ #202^3220216.122253^84"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,0)="^^21^21^3220216"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,1,0)="Patch DVBA*2.7*240 is addressing error handling for communication between "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,2,0)="CAPRI and Veterans Benefits Management System (VBMS)."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,3,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,4,0)="The CAPRI GUI will present a new error message for Clinical Document "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,5,0)="transmission failures and allow users to retry the document"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,6,0)="transmission."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,7,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,8,0)="Three new statuses in CAPRI TEMPLATE ^DVB(396.17) file are"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,9,0)="being introduced. These new statuses are: Permanent Failure, Transmission"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,10,0)="Error and Signed.  These new statuses will provide a clearer, documented"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,11,0)="status for transmission errors of the Disability Benefit Questionnaire"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,12,0)="(DBQ) to the Veterans Benefits Management System (VBMS)."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,13,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,14,0)="Patch DVBA*2.7*240 is adding the new statuses for use in the Template "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,15,0)="Report that users can select using the Compensation and Pension Record"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,16,0)="Interchange (CAPRI) GUI."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,17,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,18,0)="Patch DVBA*2.7*240 is adjusting the Joint Longitudinal Viewer (JLV) "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,19,0)="functionality to launch with the default browser, instead of forcing "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,20,0)="Internet Explorer (IE). This change will prevent JLV from having a "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",191,1,21,0)="dependency on IE due to the nature of how CAPRI launches a JLV session."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",192,0)="239 SEQ #203^3220329.141151^86"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",192,1,0)="^^2^2^3220329"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",192,1,1,0)="This patch updates the AMIE EXAM (#396.6) file by adding the new DBQ"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",192,1,2,0)="Spina bifida entry."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",193,0)="241 SEQ #204^3220510.142706^86"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",193,1,0)="^^5^5^3220510"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",193,1,1,0)="Patch DVBA*2.7*241 addresses when running Pending C&P Exams report in"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",193,1,2,0)="CAPRI GUI application and Pending C&P Exam Report [DVBA C PENDING REPORT]"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",193,1,3,0)="option in VistA, if the patient name is found after 'ZZZ', the code "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",193,1,4,0)="continuously loops and eventually the file fills the update and site"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",193,1,5,0)="gets the file full error."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,0)="238 SEQ #205^3220811.151526^86"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,0)="^^25^25^3220811"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,1,0)="The BFI DocOperations service that CAPRI GUI currently uses as an "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,2,0)="endpoint for sending Clinical Documents to eFolder resides on a server "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,3,0)="that is scheduled for decommissioning by the end August 2022. In order to "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,4,0)="maintain the capability to send Clinical Documents to eFolder, CAPRI will "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,5,0)="send documents directly to eFolder."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,6,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,7,0)="1.      VistA has been modified to add CAPRI CLINICAL EFOLDER "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,8,0)="        TRANSMISSIONS File (#396.21) to store transmission metrics for"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,9,0)="        eFolder processes."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,10,0)="2.      VistA has been modified to add a new Security Key to allow DVBA "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,11,0)="        CAPRI GUI users to send clinical documents to the eFolder."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,12,0)="3.      VistA has been modified to add a new option to allow users to run "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,13,0)="        a report of the eFolder transmission metrics"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,14,0)="4.      VistA has been modified to add a new security key and option to "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,15,0)="        allow a user to purge eFolder transmission data."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,16,0)="5.      VistA has been modified to add DVBA METRICS DATA REPORT to the "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,17,0)="        DVBA C MEDICAL ADM REPORT MENU"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,18,0)="6.      VistA has been modified to add DVBA METRICS DATA PURGE to the "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,19,0)="        DVBA C C&P MASTER MENU"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,20,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,21,0)="To comply with the VA Enterprise TRM requirements, the CAPRI GUI is "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,22,0)="updating to Delphi 10.4."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,23,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,24,0)="Patch DVBA*2.3*238 is also addressing INC21519211: CAPRI - "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",194,1,25,0)="unable to sign DBQ - DBQ XML schema validation failed."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",195,0)="245 SEQ #206^3220822.14455^86"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",195,1,0)="^^108^108^3220822"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",195,1,1,0)="Patch DVBA*2.7*245 will fix the following issue:"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",195,1,2,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",195,1,3,0)="CAPRI GUI VBA Users are receiving a 401 error when sending documents using"
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",195,1,4,0)="the send to VBA eFolder."
^DIC(9.4,93,22,21,"PAH",195,1,5,0)=" "
