^DIC(9.4,96,0)="DENTAL^DENT^NATIONAL DENTAL PACKAGE"
^DIC(9.4,96,1,0)="^^22^22^2970903^^^^"
^DIC(9.4,96,1,1,0)="The Dental package captures data on all sittings (Dental treatments)"
^DIC(9.4,96,1,2,0)="performed in the Dental Service.  It also captures data on Dental fee"
^DIC(9.4,96,1,3,0)="basis patients, applications for care and on days worked by Dental"
^DIC(9.4,96,1,4,0)="Service personnel and the amount of time spent in clinical and non"
^DIC(9.4,96,1,5,0)="clinical activities."
^DIC(9.4,96,1,6,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,96,1,7,0)="The package generates all required Dental AMIS reports and is capable of"
^DIC(9.4,96,1,8,0)="transmitting the data to Austin, Texas through the VADATS electronic"
^DIC(9.4,96,1,9,0)="network using Network Mailman or by magnetic tape."
^DIC(9.4,96,1,10,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,96,1,11,0)="The package also provides support for developing a treatment plan for"
^DIC(9.4,96,1,12,0)="individual patients by determining the number of appointments needed"
^DIC(9.4,96,1,13,0)="for each type of care to be provided and which appointments can be"
^DIC(9.4,96,1,14,0)="scheduled concurrently or must be scheduled consecutively."
^DIC(9.4,96,1,15,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,96,1,16,0)="In addition to the AMIS reports, there is also a report to determine"
^DIC(9.4,96,1,17,0)="which inpatients need a dental exam and one to print out sittings/visits"
^DIC(9.4,96,1,18,0)="for one or all providers."
^DIC(9.4,96,1,19,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,96,1,20,0)="There is a separate menu for the managers of the Dental package which"
^DIC(9.4,96,1,21,0)="allows them to set up basic files, delete erroneous entries and re-release"
^DIC(9.4,96,1,22,0)="data to Austin that was rejected due to an error."
^DIC(9.4,96,4,0)="^9.44PA^32^32"
