^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,250,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,251,0)=" INSTALLATION INSTRUCTIONS FOR DENT*1.2*43"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,252,0)=" ======================================================================"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,253,0)=" This patch must be installed when there are no dental DRM processes"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,254,0)=" running.  All open DRM and DRM Plus GUI applications must be closed."
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,255,0)=" The installation time should take less than 5 minutes."
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,256,0)="   "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,257,0)=" 1. Obtain the Dent_1_2P43.kid file"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,258,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,259,0)=" 2. For DSM sites review your mapped set.  Disable any of the above"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,260,0)="    routines if necessary"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,261,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,262,0)=" 3. From the Kernel Installation and Distribution System Menu, select"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,263,0)="    the Installation menu"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,264,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,265,0)=" 4. Use Load a Distribution and enter Dent_1_2P43.kid when prompted"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,266,0)="    for a Host file.  You may need to attach a directory name"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,267,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,268,0)=" 5. You may elect to use the following options (when prompted for "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,269,0)="    INSTALL NAME, enter DENT*1.2*43)"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,270,0)="    a. Backup a Transport Global"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,271,0)="    b. Compare Transport Global to Current System"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,272,0)="    c. Verify Checksums in Transport Global"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,273,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,274,0)=" 6. Use the Install Package(s) option and select package DENT*1.2*43"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,275,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,276,0)=" 7. For the install prompts, enter either Yes or No depending upon the"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,277,0)="    normal practice at your facility.  This example shows answering NO:"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,278,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,279,0)=" Want KIDS to Rebuild Menu Trees Upon Completion of Install? YES// NO"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,280,0)=" Want KIDS to INHIBIT LOGONs during the install? YES// NO"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,281,0)=" Want to DISABLE Scheduled Options, Menu Options, and Protocols? YES// NO"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,282,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,283,0)=" 8. AXP/DSM Sites - After the patch has been installed, rebuild your "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,284,0)="    map set, if necessary"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,285,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,286,0)=" ======================================================================="
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,287,0)="                        POST-INSTALLATION PROCESS"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,288,0)=" ======================================================================="
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,289,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,290,0)=" 1. If your site is running dentalmrm.exe (DRM), then"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,291,0)="       Move dentalmrm.exe to   ...\DOCSTORE  "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,292,0)="      '...\' indicates your path for where DRM is located."
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,293,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,294,0)=" 2. If your site is running dentalmrmtx.exe (DRM Plus)"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,295,0)="       Move dentalmrmtx.exe to   ...\DOCSTORE"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,296,0)="      '...\' indicates your path for where DRM Plus is located."
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,297,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,298,0)=" 3. Some sites are having a problem viewing the Version Notes from the"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,299,0)="    DRM/DRM Plus Help menu. The .ini parameters may not have been changed"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,300,0)="    based on the installation instructions in a previous patch.  In order"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,301,0)="    to view Version Notes, the correct FTP parameters must exist in the "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,302,0)="    dentalmrm.ini file found on the ...\DOCSTORE directory where the "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,303,0)="    executable exists:"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,304,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,305,0)="    FTPHOST=ftp.docstorsys.com"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,306,0)="    FTPPASSWORD=dss376"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,307,0)="    FTPUSERID=DRM"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,308,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,309,0)=" ========================================================================"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,310,0)="                           SAMPLE INSTALLATION"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",25,1,311,0)=" ========================================================================"
