^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",29,1,44,0)="   "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",29,1,45,0)=" 1. Load the KIDS Distribution from the Packman Message using the "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",29,1,46,0)="    Packman function ""Install/Check Message.""  (Note: test sites will"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",29,1,47,0)="    receive the kids build in a .zip file with the patch description.)"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",29,1,48,0)="    "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",29,1,49,0)=" 2. Use the Install Package(s) option and select package DENT*1.2*51"
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",29,1,50,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,96,22,1.2,"PAH",29,1,51,0)=" 3. For the install prompts, enter either Yes or No depending upon the"
