^DIC(9.4,100,22,15,"PAH",21,1,200,0)="This option is used to launch the lower level protocol for the"
^DIC(9.4,100,22,15,"PAH",21,1,201,0)="appropriate device.  Please select the node with which you want"
^DIC(9.4,100,22,15,"PAH",21,1,202,0)="to communicate"
