^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",54,1,1,0)="This patch contains enhancements for Fee Basis related to VA compliance"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",54,1,2,0)="with the HIPAA transaction and code set final rule.  This patch will"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",54,1,3,0)="support the new Fee Payment Processing System (FPPS) located at the Health"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",54,1,4,0)="Administration Center (HAC) in Denver."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",55,0)="60 SEQ #59^3031121^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",55,1,0)="^^2^2^3031121"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",55,1,1,0)="A FEE BASIS ROUTINE WAS MODIFIED TO CORRECTLY TEST FOR PREVIOUS PAYMENTS "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",55,1,2,0)="BEFORE ALLOWING THE CANCELLING OF AUTHORIZATIONS."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",56,0)="59 SEQ #60^3031121^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",56,1,0)="^^1^1^3031121"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",56,1,1,0)="RESOLVE FEE BASIS ID CARD IN PATIENT MERGE AND CORRECT DD DECRIPTION"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",57,0)="67 SEQ #61^3031126^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",57,1,0)="^^1^1^3031126"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",57,1,1,0)="PROBLEM WITH MULTIPLE PAYMENT ENTRY"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",58,0)="68 SEQ #62^3031231^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",58,1,0)="^^4^4^3031231"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",58,1,1,0)="This patch addresses the following NOIS."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",58,1,2,0)=" ISW-1103-20349 Adjustment data not sent to FPPS when amount is negative."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",58,1,3,0)=" MIN-1103-40659 Undefined variable FBFPPSC when prescription added to"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",58,1,4,0)="                previously entered pharmacy invoice."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",59,0)="64 SEQ #63^3040131^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",59,1,0)="^^2^2^3040131"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",59,1,1,0)="CORRECT THE THE STATISTICAL ROUTINE FBUCSTAT TO NOT COUNT REJECTED "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",59,1,2,0)="PAYMENTS."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",60,0)="65 SEQ #64^3040131^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",60,1,0)="^^4^4^3040131"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",60,1,1,0)="If a ""?"" is entered at the Enter Nursing Home Rate: prompt while using "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",60,1,2,0)="the Update Vendor Contract/Rates - CNH [FBCNH UPDATE VENDOR CONTRACT]"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",60,1,3,0)="option, an undefined error for variable DIR(0) may occur or DIR gets lost"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",60,1,4,0)="and displays number select display of rates."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",61,0)="69 SEQ #65^3040330^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",61,1,0)="^^7^7^3040330"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",61,1,1,0)="Enhancement patch to"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",61,1,2,0)="1. Enhance selected existing reports to include new data captured since"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",61,1,3,0)="   patch FB*3.5*61."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",61,1,4,0)="2. Add new report to list unauthorized EDI claims that were disapproved."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",61,1,5,0)="3. Update VA fee schedule compilation to consider units for claims with a"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",61,1,6,0)="   date of service in FY 2004."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",61,1,7,0)="4. Modify Selection Capability for Suspension Letters Module."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",62,0)="75 SEQ #66^3040330^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",63,0)="76 SEQ #67^3040507^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",63,1,0)="^^1^1^3040507"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",63,1,1,0)="MODIFY POTENTIAL COST RECOVERY REPORT"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",64,0)="72 SEQ #68^3040702^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",64,1,0)="^^2^2^3040702"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",64,1,1,0)="This patch will prevent the canceling of a Fee Basis Authorization with "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",64,1,2,0)="no vendor specified that has payments associated to it."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",65,0)="73 SEQ #69^3040702^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",65,1,0)="^^3^3^3040702"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",65,1,1,0)="This Patch addresses two issues: The first, Allow the sites to suspend "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",65,1,2,0)="payment for a prescription that is not covered. The second, To correct "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",65,1,3,0)="the ""AF"" X-ref by using FileMan call to populate the field AUTHORIZATION."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",66,0)="70 SEQ #70^3040802^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",66,1,0)="^^1^1^3040802"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",66,1,1,0)="HIPAA CC PHASE III"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",67,0)="71^3040802^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",67,1,0)="^^3^3^3040802"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",67,1,1,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",67,1,2,0)="This patch adds the RBRVS fee schedule for calendar year 2004 to the FEE"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",67,1,3,0)="BASIS software."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",68,0)="78 SEQ #72^3040903^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",68,1,0)="^^4^4^3040903"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",68,1,1,0)="Fee Basis Encapsulation API enhancement."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",68,1,2,0)=" Add API $$RXSUM^FBRXUTL()"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",68,1,3,0)=" Add API $$AUTHL^FBUTL()"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",68,1,4,0)=" Modify API EN^FBHLZFE()"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",69,0)="79 SEQ #73^3041015^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",69,1,0)="^^5^5^3041015"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",69,1,1,0)="This patch addresses the problem encountered when the DATE OF SERVICE is "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",69,1,2,0)="entered for an outpatient or ancillary payment(FEE BASIS PAYMENT #162 "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",69,1,3,0)="file), the software will inappropriately skip the validation checks when "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",69,1,4,0)="there is already data on file for the same PATIENT, VENDOR, and INITIAL "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",69,1,5,0)="TREATMENT DATE (date of service)."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",70,0)="77 SEQ #74^3041015^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",70,1,0)="^^1^1^3041015"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",70,1,1,0)="CODE TEXT DESCRIPTORS"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",71,0)="81 SEQ #77^3041228^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",71,1,0)="^^3^3^3041228"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",71,1,1,0)="This patch addresses two issues; one involving the assigning of  FEE "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",71,1,2,0)="BASIS BATCH numbers and the second involving the assignment of FB INVOICE "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",71,1,3,0)="numbers."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",72,0)="84 SEQ #75^3041228^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",72,1,0)="^^6^6^3041228"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",72,1,1,0)="This modification is to have the software skip the RBRVS fee"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",72,1,2,0)="  schedule when modifier SG (ASC FACILITY SERVICE) has been entered.  The"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",72,1,3,0)="  software would still check the VA Fee Schedule (75th percentile).  If"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",72,1,4,0)="  the CPT and modifiers were not found on the VA Fee Schedule then it"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",72,1,5,0)="  would return a message - ""Unable to determine a FEE schedule amount."".  "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",72,1,6,0)="  In that case, the fee clerk could enter a usual & customary amount."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",73,0)="82 SEQ #76^3041228^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",73,1,0)="^^4^4^3041228"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",73,1,1,0)="This patch makes the following changes:"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",73,1,2,0)=" o Use new PTF APIs to create or delete a PTF record."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",73,1,3,0)=" o Correct a fault that prevents deletion of a PTF record for community "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",73,1,4,0)="   nursing home."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",74,0)="85 SEQ #78^3050204^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",74,1,0)="^^2^2^3050204"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",74,1,1,0)="Correct the initialization of the variable that hold the out put text for "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",74,1,2,0)="the Detail Description."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",75,0)="80 SEQ #79^3050426^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",75,1,0)="^^2^2^3050426"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",75,1,1,0)="This patch addresses the problem encountered when the pharmacist is "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",75,1,2,0)="reviewing Fee Basis Prescriptions."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",76,0)="91 SEQ #80^3050813^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",76,1,0)="^^5^5^3050813"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",76,1,1,0)="This patch replaces a direct global read of the PSDRUG global by a VA "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",76,1,2,0)="Fileman call in support of the Pharmacy Encapsulation project.  It also"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",76,1,3,0)="fixes a bug that prevented display of the generic drug equivalent during"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",76,1,4,0)="completion of a fee pharmacy invoice.  It also fixes problems with the "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",76,1,5,0)="edit after review functionality of the Review Fee Prescription option."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",77,0)="89 SEQ #81^3050924^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",77,1,0)="^^3^3^3050924"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",77,1,1,0)="The patch enhances all four payment batch formats (B3, B5, B9, and BT) "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",77,1,2,0)="that are transmitted from VistA Fee Basis to Central FEE (AAC) to include"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",77,1,3,0)="additional data elements."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",78,0)="92^3051020^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",78,1,0)="^^2^2^3051020"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",78,1,1,0)="This patch adds the RBRVS fee schedule for calendar year 2005 to the FEE"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",78,1,2,0)="BASIS software."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",79,0)="95 SEQ #83^3051221^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",79,1,0)="^^2^2^3051221"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",79,1,1,0)="Patient lookup warnings scroll too fast to be noticed [FBAA ENTER "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",79,1,2,0)="AUTHORIZATION]."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",80,0)="96^3060213^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",80,1,0)="^^1^1^3060213"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",80,1,1,0)="Adding ALABAMA zip codes."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",81,0)="90 SEQ #85^3060410^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",81,1,0)="^^2^2^3060410"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",81,1,1,0)="This patch fixes the Millennium Act Emergency Care Summary Report [FBUC "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",81,1,2,0)="MILL ACT SUMMARY]."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",82,0)="93^3060504^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",82,1,0)="^^1^1^3060504"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",82,1,1,0)="RVU API AND RELATED MODIFICATIONS"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",83,0)="94 SEQ #87^3060525^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",83,1,0)="^^1^1^3060525"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",83,1,1,0)="Incorrect date used to validate the DRG and/or ICD effective date."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",84,0)="99^3060711^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",84,1,0)="^^1^1^3060711"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",84,1,1,0)="ANNUAL UPDATE FOR RBRVS FEE SCHEDULE"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",85,0)="97 SEQ #89^3060807^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",85,1,0)="^^6^6^3060807"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",85,1,1,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",85,1,2,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",85,1,3,0)="This patch is issued to compensate for the longer MRA message to be "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",85,1,4,0)="received from Austin Central Fee.  Central fee will begin sending MRA "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",85,1,5,0)="messages containing spaced for the NPI number before the NPI enhancement"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",85,1,6,0)="patch (FB*3.5*98) is released."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",86,0)="100 SEQ #90^3060824^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",86,1,0)="^^1^1^3060824"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",86,1,1,0)="2006 RBRVS Conversion Factor update"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",87,0)="98 SEQ #91^3070629.185041^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",87,1,0)="^^3^3^3070629"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",87,1,1,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",87,1,2,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",87,1,3,0)="NPI Modifications for the Fee Basis package"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",88,0)="101 SEQ #92^3070904.222455^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",88,1,0)="^^9^9^3070904"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",88,1,1,0)="The VistA Fee Basis application provides forms, letters and reports that "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",88,1,2,0)="are sent between VHA, vendors and veterans.  This patch modifies VistA "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",88,1,3,0)="Fee Basis by replacing the full SSN on those forms, letters and reports "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",88,1,4,0)="with X's for the first 5 digits and only printing the last 4 digits in "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",88,1,5,0)="the following format: "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",88,1,6,0)="          XXX-XX-#### or XXXXX####"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",88,1,7,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",88,1,8,0)="   **Note that X represents an actual X and # represents the actual SSN"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",88,1,9,0)="   digit. Pseudo SSN will be changed as above with passed ""P"" at end."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",89,0)="102^3070905.002237^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",89,1,0)="^^1^1^3070905"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",89,1,1,0)="2007 RBRVS ANNUAL UPDATE"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",90,0)="104 SEQ #94^3080526.191016^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",90,1,0)="^^1^1^3080526"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",90,1,1,0)="Correct Fee Basis RVU values for two CPT codes."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",91,0)="105^3080526.195919^1"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",91,1,0)="^^1^1^3080526"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",91,1,1,0)="2008 RBRVS UPDATE"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",92,0)="103 SEQ #96^3090421.134856^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",92,1,0)="^^2^2^3090421"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",92,1,1,0)="Add the Referring Provider NPI Information to 10-7078 and 10-7079"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",92,1,2,0)="Fee Authorization Forms."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",93,0)="109^3090423.131241^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",93,1,0)="^^5^5^3090423"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",93,1,1,0)="FB*3.5*109 has the following changes:"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",93,1,2,0)="-Adds the Resource Based Relative Value Schedule (RBRVS) fee schedule"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",93,1,3,0)=" for the calendar year 2009.  "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",93,1,4,0)="-Adds Purpose of Visit 56, 67, 68, and 69.  "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",93,1,5,0)="-Inactivates Purpose of Visit 20 effective January 01, 2009.  "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",94,0)="110 SEQ #98^3090623.103648^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",94,1,0)="^^4^4^3090623"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",94,1,1,0)="FB*3.5*110 does the following: "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",94,1,2,0)="- modifies the payments for Psychiatry CPT codes."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",94,1,3,0)="- modifies Relative Value Units for CPT 67113.  "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",94,1,4,0)="- adds additional information to the POV codes 56, 67, 68, and 69."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",95,0)="107 SEQ #99^3090630.111924^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",95,1,0)="^^4^4^3090630"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",95,1,1,0)="First patch of Fee Data & HERO enhancement:"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",95,1,2,0)=" o Increase maximum size of disbursed amount in FEE BASIS INVOICE file."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",95,1,3,0)=" o Update S.FBAA PAID SERVER to process either old or new format of the"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",95,1,4,0)="   payment confirmation message."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",96,0)="111^3100421.174^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",96,1,0)="^^17^17^3100421"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",96,1,1,0)="FB*3.5*111 does the following:"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",96,1,2,0)="- Updates the Resource Based Relative Value Schedule (RBRVS) fee schedule "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",96,1,3,0)="  with changes made in January, April and July 2009.  "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",96,1,4,0)="- Updates the Department of Labor OWCP Modifier data to the 2009 values.  "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",96,1,5,0)="- Corrects a problem when attempting to add multiple rates to a "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",96,1,6,0)="  contract.  "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",96,1,7,0)="- Corrects a problem when entering Current Procedural Terminology (CPT) "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",96,1,8,0)="  code 0159T for payment.  "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",96,1,9,0)="- Corrects the calculation for CPT code 0073T."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",96,1,10,0)="- Corrects a problem with a warning message displaying inappropriately "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",96,1,11,0)="  when using the Enter Authorization [FBAA ENTER AUTHORIZATION] option. "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",96,1,12,0)="- Corrects an erroneous message that a vendor is pending Austin "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",96,1,13,0)="  Automation Center (AAC) approval when they aren't.  "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",96,1,14,0)="- Corrects a problem where the FEE ID REPORT is missing patients."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",96,1,15,0)="- Removes the SSN/Claim # from the NON-VA AUTHORIZATION FORM"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",96,1,16,0)="- Corrects a problem with the AMIS 349 report.  "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",96,1,17,0)="- Corrects several locking problems.  "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",97,0)="112^3100624.115432^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",97,1,0)="^^5^5^3100624"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",97,1,1,0)="FB*3.5*112 does the following:"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",97,1,2,0)=" -Updates the Resource Based Relative Value Schedule (RBRVS) fee schedule "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",97,1,3,0)="  with changes for October 2009.  "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",97,1,4,0)=" -updates the Resource Based Relative Value Schedule (RBRVS) fee schedule"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",97,1,5,0)="  with changes for Calendar Year (CY) 2010. "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",98,0)="114 SEQ #102^3110224.142424^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",98,1,0)="^^7^7^3110224"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",98,1,1,0)="This patch does the following:"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",98,1,2,0)="- corrects a problem with two Fee Basis routines that aren't updating "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",98,1,3,0)="  data properly.  "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",98,1,4,0)="- corrects the wrong data displaying when using the Enter Unauthorized "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",98,1,5,0)="  Claim [FBUC UNAUTHORIZED] option.  "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",98,1,6,0)="- corrects a warning that is not displayed when running low on available "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",98,1,7,0)="  batches."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",99,0)="115^3110225.123919^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",99,1,0)="^^3^3^3110225"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",99,1,1,0)="This patch updates the following:"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",99,1,2,0)="- Place of Service Codes"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",99,1,3,0)="- Adjustment Reasons"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",100,0)="116 SEQ #104^3110321.143955^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",101,0)="117 SEQ #105^3110531.143928^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",101,1,0)="^^4^4^3110531"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",101,1,1,0)="This patch enhances VistA Fee Basis to enforce segregation of duties when"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",101,1,2,0)="payments are certified.  This patch also adds the new FB SEG DUTY RPT"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",101,1,3,0)="option and modifies the batch purge functionality to require the date to"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",101,1,4,0)="be at least 18 months ago."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",102,0)="118^3110616.14243^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",102,1,0)="^^6^6^3110616"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",102,1,1,0)="FB*3.5*118 does the following:"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",102,1,2,0)=" -Updates the Resource Based Relative Value Schedule (RBRVS) fee schedule "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",102,1,3,0)="  with changes for October 2010.  "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",102,1,4,0)=" -Updates the Resource Based Relative Value Schedule (RBRVS) fee schedule"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",102,1,5,0)="  with changes for Calendar Year (CY) 2011. "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",102,1,6,0)=" -Updates the modifiers to be more compliant with medicare rules."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",103,0)="119^3110622.085617^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",103,1,0)="^^1^1^3110622"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",103,1,1,0)="ARCH project for Fee Basis"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",104,0)="121 SEQ #109^3110822.1121^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",105,0)="122 SEQ #110^3120104.091057^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",106,0)="133 SEQ #111^3120104.091108^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",107,0)="130 SEQ #112^3120307.130642^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",108,0)="138^3120308.153831^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",109,0)="131 SEQ #114^3120829.105845^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",109,1,0)="^^5^5^3120829"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",109,1,1,0)="This patch is part of the VistA Fee and IFCAP Automation Enhancements"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",109,1,2,0)="project (aka Duplicate Payments).  This patch will enable Fee Basis to"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",109,1,3,0)="receive three new types of messages from Central Fee.  However the data in"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",109,1,4,0)="these message will ignored by this patch.  A subsequent patch, FB*3.5*132,"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",109,1,5,0)="will contain the functionality to process the data sent by Central Fee."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",110,0)="108 SEQ #115^3120829.11552^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",110,1,0)="^^10^10^3120829"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",110,1,1,0)="This patch will enhance Fee Basis to capture additional data associated "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",110,1,2,0)="with non-VA care.  Contracts can be specified for Medical Fee and Civil"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",110,1,3,0)="Hospital authorizations and payments.  Civil hospital invoices will allow "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",110,1,4,0)="entry of larger dollar amounts, additional diagnosis codes, present on"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",110,1,5,0)="admission indicators for diagnosis codes, the admitting diagnosis code,"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",110,1,6,0)="and additional procedure codes.  The existing transmissions to NVH Pricer"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",110,1,7,0)="and Central Fee will be modified to include additional data elements.  The"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",110,1,8,0)="transmission of these additional data elements will make it possible to"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",110,1,9,0)="comply with inpatient pricing requirements and improve the ability of the"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",110,1,10,0)="VA to review and report on purchased care."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",111,0)="120^3120829.125252^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",111,1,0)="^^4^4^3120829"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",111,1,1,0)="This patch addresses the following:"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",111,1,2,0)=" -Updates the Resource Based Relative Value Scale (RBRVS) fee schedule"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",111,1,3,0)="  with changes for Calendar Year (CY) 2012."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",111,1,4,0)=" -Updates some Relative Value Units (RVUs) for the RBRVS for CY 2011.  "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",112,0)="124 SEQ #117^3120905.094531^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",112,1,0)="^^4^4^3120905"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",112,1,1,0)="VISTA FINANCIALS ANNUAL ENHANCEMENT 7 - FEE INVOICE DATE CONTROLS"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",112,1,2,0)="UPDATED TO INCLUDE PATCH 108 BUILD USER$:[THAYERC]FEE3_5P108T0307A.KID"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",112,1,3,0)="Also add 2 new routines (FBAACO1 and FBCHEP) for INPATIENT invoice  "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",112,1,4,0)="date validation."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",113,0)="135 SEQ #118^3130122.171734^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",113,1,0)="^^3^3^3130122"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",113,1,1,0)="FIRST BUILD OF FEE BASIS v3.5 PATCH 135  being created for phase two of "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",113,1,2,0)="the VistA 5010 Fee Basis project. This build only contains data "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",113,1,3,0)="dictionary updates"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,0)="132 SEQ #119^3130205.124139^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,0)="^^22^22^3130205"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,1,0)="This patch is part of the VistA Fee and IFCAP Automation Enhancements"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,2,0)="project (aka Duplicate Payments)."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,3,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,4,0)="This patch will enhance the interface between VistA Fee Basis and Central"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,5,0)="Fee to improve the consistency of payment line item data between the"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,6,0)="systems.  This will prevent duplicate ICN payments by ensuring that a "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,7,0)="payment line cannot be reprocessed in VistA Fee Basis unless it has been "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,8,0)="removed from Central Fee.  The primary interface enhancements consist of "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,9,0)="the following:"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,10,0)=" o Rejection of payment line items by Central Fee will be transmitted to"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,11,0)="   VistA Fee Basis via new transactions that update the VistA database.  "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,12,0)="   Users will no longer manually record such rejects in VistA."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,13,0)=" o Completion of a payment batch using the Finalize a Batch option in"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,14,0)="   VistA Fee Basis will automatically generate a new transaction that is"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,15,0)="   sent to Central Fee.  This new transaction will instruct Central Fee of"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,16,0)="   any payment line items that must be deleted (i.e. local rejects) and"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,17,0)="   instruct Central Fee to release the remainder of the batch to"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,18,0)="   downstream payment systems such as FMS.  This new transaction will"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,19,0)="   replace all use of 994 code sheets in IFCAP."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,20,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,21,0)="This patch also resolves three existing software faults that were "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",114,1,22,0)="discovered during analysis and design of the patch."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",115,0)="145^3130614.093135^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",115,1,0)="^^5^5^3130614"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",115,1,1,0)="This patch addresses the following:"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",115,1,2,0)="- Updates the Resource Based Relative Value Scale (RBRVS) Fee Schedule "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",115,1,3,0)="  with changes for Calendar Year (CY) 2013."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",115,1,4,0)="- Stops the payout of Mental Health Services at 105% after March 1st, 2012"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",115,1,5,0)="  as per the Middle Class Tax Relief and Job Creation Act of 2012."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",116,0)="147 SEQ #121^3130823.110548^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",116,1,0)="^^3^3^3130823"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",116,1,1,0)="This patch adds two new Purpose Of Visit (POV) codes to the Fee Basis "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",116,1,2,0)="Purpose of Visit (#161.82) file for Newborn care, and updates the name of "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",116,1,3,0)="one existing POV code."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",117,0)="144 SEQ #122^3130904.094525^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",117,1,0)="^^6^6^3130904"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",117,1,1,0)="This patch addresses the following:"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",117,1,2,0)="- Modifies the logic when determining the symbols used for payments "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",117,1,3,0)="  in the Payment History Display."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",117,1,4,0)="- Resolves an undefined error in routine FBPHON from variable DFN."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",117,1,5,0)="- Resolves an undefined error within the [TRAVEL PAYMENT] option due to "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",117,1,6,0)="  batch files missing a status."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,0)="146^3131212.141029^17"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,0)="^^352^352^3131212"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,1,0)="                           ***NOTICE***"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,2,0)=" Users should be made aware that processing of Newborn claims must ONLY be"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,3,0)=" entered in VistA. No entry in FBCS should be performed."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,4,0)="                            ***********"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,5,0)=" This patch, along with FB*3.5*146 and IB*2.0*499, is being released as a"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,6,0)=" bundle, and all three will be automatically installed in the correct order."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,7,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,8,0)=" This patch has enhancements that extend the capabilities of the Veterans"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,9,0)=" Health Information Systems and Technology Architecture (VistA) Patient"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,10,0)=" Registration system (DG), Fee Basis System (FB), and Integrated Billing"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,11,0)=" (IB)."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,12,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,13,0)=" Below is a list of all the applications involved in this project along with"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,14,0)=" their patch number:"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,15,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,16,0)="     APPLICATION/VERSION                                   PATCH"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,17,0)="     ---------------------------------------------------------------"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,18,0)="  PATIENT REGISTRATION (DG) V 5.3                       DG*5.3*867"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,19,0)="  FEE BASIS (FB) V 3.5                                  FB*3.5*146"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,20,0)="  INTEGRATED BILLING (IB) 2.0                           IB*2.0*499"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,21,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,22,0)=" The patches (DG*5.3*867, FB*3.5*146, and IB*2.0*499) are being released in the"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,23,0)=" Kernel Installation and Distribution System (KIDS) multi-build distribution"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,24,0)=" NEWBORN DG FB IB BUNDLE 1.0"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,25,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,26,0)=" The purpose of the Caregivers: Newborn Claims Processing Enhancement Project"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,27,0)=" is to enhance VistA Fee Basis application in support of compliance with"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,28,0)=" Public Law 111-163, the Caregiver and Veterans Omnibus Health Services Act"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,29,0)=" of 2010. This law makes changes to sections of Title 38, United States Code"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,30,0)=" to furnish health care services to a newborn child of a Woman Veteran who"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,31,0)=" is receiving maternity care furnished by the Department of Veterans Affairs"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,32,0)=" (VA) for not more than seven days after the birth of the child."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,33,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,34,0)=" The scope of these enhancements is to capture information on healthcare"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,35,0)=" services provided to newborn children of Women Veterans. Affected functions"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,36,0)=" include eligibility determination, enrollment and registration, documentation"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,37,0)=" of referrals and authorization for care, claims processing, and payment. Only"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,38,0)=" modification to the Fee Basis (FB) and the Registration (DG) packages are"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,39,0)=" necessary to meet the requirements of this enhancement. The Integrated"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,40,0)=" Billing (IB) Patch is included to provide required data for the Fee Basis"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,41,0)=" install to reference."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,42,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,43,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,44,0)=" The primary purpose of this enhancement is to allow the Electronic Filing of"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,45,0)=" Newborn claims."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,46,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,47,0)=" Functional Description"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,48,0)=" ------------------------------"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,49,0)=" The following features and functions have been added to the Fee Basis workflow"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,50,0)=" process applying to both Civil Hospital and Medical Fee:"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,51,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,52,0)="  1. A new Patient Type of NEWBORN OF VETERAN has been added to the TYPE OF"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,53,0)=" PATIENT file (#391). This new selection will be available on Registration"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,54,0)=" Screen <7>."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,55,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,56,0)="  2. A sponsor is required for all Newborns determined by having the DOB less"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,57,0)=" than one (1) year from the present date. An inconsistency check has been added"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,58,0)=" to check the presence of a sponsor. If an inconsistency is found the"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,59,0)=" inconsistency check will prompt the user to return to Screen <15> in"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,60,0)=" registration to enter a Sponsor."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,61,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,62,0)="  3. All Sponsors for Newborns must be listed as eligible for care. An"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,63,0)=" inconsistency check will check the status of the Sponsors Eligibility. The"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,64,0)=" check will trigger if the Sponsor has no Eligibility status."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,65,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,66,0)=" All other statuses (i.e. Pending Verification, Verified, and Pending"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,67,0)=" Re-verification) are acceptable."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,68,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,69,0)="  4. Fee Authorization dates associated with Newborns have checks in place to"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,70,0)=" not allow Authorization dates that fall outside the accepted range of Newborn"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,71,0)=" Authorization. The range is DOB to DOB+7. The system will warn the user and"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,72,0)=" not accept an Authorization date that falls outside the appropriate range for"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,73,0)=" a Newborn."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,74,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,75,0)="  5. When a Veteran Mother of a Sponsored Newborn is reviewed in the"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,76,0)=" Registration screens, Screen <15> will display the Newborn(s), with the"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,77,0)=" additional header of ""Sponsored Newborn""."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,78,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,79,0)="  6. The FAMILY PREFIX ""NB Newborn of Vet"" has been added to the Help text in"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,80,0)=" the FAMILY PREFIX field (#.03) in the SPONSOR RELATIONSHIP file (#355.81)"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,81,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,82,0)="  7. ""NON-VA FOR FEMALE VET+NEWBORN 17.38"" was added to the VA ADMITTING"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,83,0)=" REGULATION file (#43.4). This new Admitting Regulation is available when"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,84,0)=" editing the 7078."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,85,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,86,0)="  8. The following default values were added when entering a Newborn with a"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,87,0)=" date of birth of less than one (1) year from present date. Defaults will only"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,88,0)=" be assigned when specified screens are accessed during the registration"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,89,0)=" process: PATIENT DATA, SCREEN <2> Marital field is defaulted to NEVER MARRIED."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,90,0)=" APPLICANT/SPOUSE EMPLOYMENT DATA, SCREEN <4> Status field is defaulted to NOT"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,91,0)=" EMPLOYED. FAMILY DEMOGRAPHIC DATA, SCREEN <8> Married Last Year field is"
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,92,0)=" defaulted to NO."
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,93,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,114,22,30,"PAH",118,1,94,0)=" "
