^DIC(9.4,119,0)="INTERIM MANAGEMENT SUPPORT^ECT^Information for VAMC's management."
^DIC(9.4,119,1,0)="^^5^5^2910129^^^^"
^DIC(9.4,119,1,1,0)="The purpose of DHCP Interim Management Support is to provide"
^DIC(9.4,119,1,2,0)="accessible, reliable, and useful information to management within"
^DIC(9.4,119,1,3,0)="the VAMC.  Information pertains to the center, its workload, and its"
^DIC(9.4,119,1,4,0)="resources.  The primary source of data for the module is the hospital's"
^DIC(9.4,119,1,5,0)="DHCP applications/packages and associated files."
^DIC(9.4,119,4,0)="^9.44PA^5^5"
