^DIC(9.4,124,22,12,"PAH",35,1,3,0)="is set to ""NO"" in the PROCEDURE/SUBSPECIALTY file (#697.2) for that "
^DIC(9.4,124,22,12,"PAH",35,1,4,0)="procedure."
