^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,1,0)="It is very important to install this patch prior to the end of"
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,2,0)="the quarter to assure that Prosthetics will report accurate"
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,3,0)="information."
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,4,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,5,0)="Sites that have a Prosthetic Lab, AMIS currently will double count 2421's."
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,6,0)=" This patch corrects this problem."
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,7,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,8,0)="When the option 'List Open Stock Issues' is used, the new VISA Purchase"
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,9,0)="Card transactions show on the list as well as Stock Issues.  This patch"
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,10,0)="will correct this problem."
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,11,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,12,0)="Some sites have not been reporting all Issue From Stock transactions on"
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,13,0)="AMIS due to the Delivery Date either being null, or a Delivery date"
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,14,0)="outside the AMIS reporting period.  To correct this problem, the Delivery"
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,15,0)="Date is no longer asked and the routine will stuff in the current date."
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,16,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,17,0)="Once this patch has been installed have Prosthetics use the List Open"
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,18,0)="Stock Issues option and make sure all transactions have a Delivery Date"
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,19,0)="with the date they are doing the data entry.  This will assure that all"
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,20,0)="transactions are counted on AMIS."
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,21,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,22,0)="This patch also addresses the problems from the following NOIS reports:"
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,23,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,24,0)="LAS-0596-61654 "
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,25,0)="SFC-0596-62183"
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,26,0)="MAD-0596-42179"
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,27,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,140,22,20,"PAH",1,1,28,0)="Checksum     Before      After"
