^DIC(9.4,145,0)="CLINICAL MONITORING SYSTEM^QAM^Allows users to build their own monitors."
^DIC(9.4,145,1,0)="^^7^7^2930217^"
^DIC(9.4,145,1,1,0)="The Clinical Monitoring System allows the users to create their own"
^DIC(9.4,145,1,2,0)="monitors from a list of pre-defined conditions.  The monitors then run"
^DIC(9.4,145,1,3,0)="nightly, scanning DHCP data for patients who meet the conditions of the"
^DIC(9.4,145,1,4,0)="monitor.  The user may select data elements from a pre-defined list to be"
^DIC(9.4,145,1,5,0)="captured when a patient falls out for a given monitor.  Programmers may"
^DIC(9.4,145,1,6,0)="add new data elements and conditions to the system.  Users can design and"
^DIC(9.4,145,1,7,0)="print ad hoc reports from the fall out data."
^DIC(9.4,145,4,0)="^9.44PA^9^9"
