^DIC(9.4,148,1,1,0)="The Spinal Cord Dysfunction package is intended to provide a registry of"
^DIC(9.4,148,1,2,0)="SCD patients and to track their functional statuses."
^DIC(9.4,148,4,0)="^9.44PA^10^10"
