^DIC(9.4,165,0)="DSS EXTRACTS^ECX^Decision Support System. (DSS)"
^DIC(9.4,165,1,0)="^^4^4^2970919^^^^"
^DIC(9.4,165,1,1,0)="The DSS software provides a way to load data from DHCP to a commercial"
^DIC(9.4,165,1,2,0)="decision support system.  The software extracts data from several DHCP"
^DIC(9.4,165,1,3,0)="files.  Extracted data elements are stored in summary files which may"
^DIC(9.4,165,1,4,0)="be reviewed before being transmitted to the commercial software."
