^DIC(9.4,175,22,2,"PAH",27,1,11,0)="This patch is an enhancement to the previous Clinical Display client.  It "
^DIC(9.4,175,22,2,"PAH",27,1,12,0)="allows users to connect and retrieve images and associated information "
^DIC(9.4,175,22,2,"PAH",27,1,13,0)="from remote sites.  This patch also provides an auto-caching feature that "
^DIC(9.4,175,22,2,"PAH",27,1,14,0)="allows the user to request images be brought to their local machine in "
^DIC(9.4,175,22,2,"PAH",27,1,15,0)="preparation for viewing."
