^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,57,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,58,0)="There is no documentation distribution included in this patch."
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,59,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,60,0)="Installation Instructions:"
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,61,0)="=========================="
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,62,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,63,0)="This patch can be installed with users on the system. Installation will"
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,64,0)="take less than 1 minute."
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,65,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,66,0)="Suggested time to install: non-peak requirement hours."
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,67,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,68,0)="   1. From the Kernel Installation & Distribution System menu, select"
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,69,0)="      the LOAD DISTRIBUTION option and load PSB_3_29.KID"
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,70,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,71,0)="   2. From the Kernel Installation & Distribution System menu, select"
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,72,0)="      the Installation menu."
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,73,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,74,0)="   3. From this menu, you may select to use the following options"
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,75,0)="      (when prompted for INSTALL NAME, enter PSB*3.0*29):"
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,76,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,77,0)="     a. Backup a Transport Global - this option will create a backup"
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,78,0)="        message of any routines exported with the patch. It will NOT"
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,79,0)="        backup any other changes such as DDs or templates."
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,80,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,81,0)="     b. Compare Transport Global to Current System - this option will"
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,82,0)="        allow you to view all changes that will be made when the patch"
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,83,0)="        is installed. It compares all components of the patch (routines,"
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,84,0)="        DDs, templates, etc.)."
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,85,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,86,0)="     c. Verify Checksums in Transport Global - this option will ensure"
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,87,0)="        the integrity of the routines that are in the transport global."
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,88,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,89,0)="   4. Use the Install Package(s) option and select the package PSB*3.0*29."
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,90,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,91,0)="   5. When prompted ""Want KIDS to INHIBIT LOGONs during the install? "
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,92,0)="      YES//"" respond NO."
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,93,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,94,0)="   6. When prompted ""Want to DISABLE Scheduled Options, Menu Options, and"
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,95,0)="      Protocols? YES//"" respond NO."
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,96,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,97,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,98,0)="Example Installation:"
^DIC(9.4,177,22,3,"PAH",20,1,99,0)="====================="
