^DIC(9.4,192,22,2,1,11,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,192,22,2,1,12,0)="The VISTALINK package contains two native request handlers. One handles "
^DIC(9.4,192,22,2,1,13,0)="system-type requests, like client heartbeats and close socket requests. "
^DIC(9.4,192,22,2,1,14,0)="The other handler processes RPC requests."
^DIC(9.4,192,22,2,1,15,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,192,22,2,1,16,0)="Other packages can also supply handlers. For example, VISTALINK SECURITY"
^DIC(9.4,192,22,2,1,17,0)="(XOBS) supplies a handler that is used to process VistA security-related"
^DIC(9.4,192,22,2,1,18,0)="requests."
