^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,234,0)="Installation Sequence "
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,235,0)="======================"
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,236,0)="The files listed below represent the patches that will be part of the "
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,237,0)="controlled phased release.  Follow the sequence listed below when your "
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,238,0)="phased installation occurs."
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,239,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,240,0)="  1. LR*5.2*335"
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,241,0)="  2. LR*5.2*367"
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,242,0)="  3. VBECS Bundle (consisting of VBEC*1*0 and LR*5.2*325)"
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,243,0)="  4. VBEC*1.0*1"
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,244,0)="  5. OR*3.0*212"
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,245,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,246,0)="Documentation Retrieval:"
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,247,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,248,0)="Documentation is available for the entire VBECS package on the "
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,249,0)="ANONYMOUS.SOFTWRE directory at one of the following Office of Information "
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,250,0)="(OI) Field Offices.  Sites may retrieve documentation in either "".PDF"" or "
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,251,0)="""DOC"" format in one of the following ways:"
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,252,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,253,0)="1.      The preferred method is to FTP the files from :"
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,254,0)="Download.vista.domain.ext"
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,255,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,256,0)="2.      Sites may also elect to retrieve documentation directly from a "
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,257,0)="specific server as follows:"
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,258,0)="       Albany                  ftp.fo-albany.domain.ext"
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,259,0)="       Hines                   ftp.fo-hines.domain.ext"
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,260,0)="       Salt Lake City          ftp.fo-slc.domain.ext"
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,261,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,262,0)="NOTE:  The documentation files listed below will be listed in each of the "
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,263,0)="VBECS and LR patches that are part of the VBECS package and associate "
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,264,0)="patches, they only need to be downloaded once."
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,265,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,266,0)="File Name                                   Retrieval format:  Binary"
^DIC(9.4,207,22,1,1,267,0)="===========                                 =========================="
