^DIC(9.4,242,0)="CLINICAL DECISION SUPPORT PLATFORM^CDSP^Clinical Decision Support Platform"
^DIC(9.4,242,7)="^^I"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,0)="^9.49I^1^1"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,0)="1.0^3231121^3240221^89"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,1,0)="^^1^1^3240221"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,1,1,0)="Adds CDSP RPC CONTEXT menu option"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",0)="^9.4901^2^2"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,0)="1 SEQ #1^3250729.15505^90"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,0)="^^41^41^3250729"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,1,0)="Clinical Decision Support Platform is the core system to power Clinical"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,2,0)="Decision Support (CDS) applications. This platform enables rapid"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,3,0)="development and deployment of applications that follow Substitutable"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,4,0)="Medical Applications and Reusable Technologies (SMART) family of "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,5,0)="standards such as SMART on FHIR (Fast Healthcare Interoperability"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,6,0)="Resources) and CDS Hooks. CDSP facilitates the launch of CDS applications"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,7,0)="from within the VA Electronic Health Record (EHR) - CPRS and Clinical"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,8,0)="Context Management (CCOW) vault patient context synchronization. The"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,9,0)="system encompasses technical infrastructure and shared capabilities to"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,10,0)="interact with electronic health record data, as well as specific"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,11,0)="applications providing clinical decision support such as Covid-19 Patient"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,12,0)="Manager (CPM), Lung Cancer Screening Platform (LCSPv2)."
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,13,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,14,0)="This patch will distribute an updated Option CDSP RPC CONTEXT. The OPTION "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,15,0)="CDSP RPC CONTEXT contains additional RPCs, all of which have new approved "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,16,0)="Integration Agreements.These additional RPCs will enable new Applications"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,17,0)="to be launched from the Clinical Decision Support Platform as listed below."
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,18,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,19,0)="Lung Cancer Screening Pv2: TIU CREATE RECORD Text Integration Utility and "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,20,0)="PXRPC SAVE2 Patient Care Encounter. These RPCs will give the Lung Cancer"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,21,0)="Screening App the ability to create TIU Documents that document actions "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,22,0)="taken during a LCSPv2 encounter."
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,23,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,24,0)="Precision Oncology: ORWPT LIST ALL Order Entry Results Reporting. Get and "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,25,0)="filter list of patients. This RPC returns a set of patient names for use "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,26,0)="with a long list box for selection by the user."
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,27,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,28,0)="Clinical Decision Support Platform: VPR GET PATIENT DATA JSON Virtual "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,29,0)="Patient Record. This RPC will be added to supports APPs such as Lung "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,30,0)="Cancer Screening and Precision Oncology. The RPC is to be used as an "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,31,0)="alternative to VPR GET PATIENT DATA, which returns data in XML.  There "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,32,0)="are frameworks identified where XML libraries often have vulnerabilities "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,33,0)="(expat and friends) and deserializing XML is more difficult than JSON."
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,34,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,35,0)="Clinical Decision Support Platform: LHS CHECK OPTION ACCESS Lighthouse. "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,36,0)="This RPC scours Primary Menu Options, Secondary Menu Options and Common "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,37,0)="Options to determine if the DUZ passed in has access to the option passed "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,38,0)="in."
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,39,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,40,0)="Task Manager: Several OR Team access RPC are being added to streamline "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",1,1,41,0)="patient selection."
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,0)="2 SEQ #2^3260210.130933^90"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,0)="^^31^31^3260210"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,1,0)="This patch will install additional necessary components to support the "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,2,0)="Clinical Decision Support Platform (CDSP).  "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,3,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,4,0)="CDSP is the core system to power Clinical Decision Support (CDS) "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,5,0)="applications. This platform enables rapid development and deployment of "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,6,0)="applications that follow Substitutable Medical Applications and Reusable "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,7,0)="Technologies (SMART) family of standards such as SMART on FHIR (Fast "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,8,0)="Healthcare  "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,9,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,10,0)="Interoperability Resources) and CDS Hooks. CDSP facilitates the launch of "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,11,0)="CDS applications from within the VA Electronic Health Record (EHR) - "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,12,0)="CPRS. The CDS Platform also relies on the Clinical Context Management "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,13,0)="(CCOW) vault to carry patient context and the synchronization of the "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,14,0)="selected patient between CPRS and the CDS Platform and thus CDS App "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,15,0)="launched from the CDS Platform. The system encompasses technical "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,16,0)="infrastructure and shared capabilities to interact with electronic health "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,17,0)="record data, as well as specific applications providing clinical decision "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,18,0)="support such as Covid-19 Patient Manager (CPM), Lung Cancer Screening "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,19,0)="Risk Calculator.  "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,20,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,21,0)="The CDSP RPC CONTEXT menu option contains the following RPCs. The RPCs "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,22,0)="added with this patch are listed below with the Integration Control"
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,23,0)="Agreement number."
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,24,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,25,0)="Added with CDSP*1.0*2 "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,26,0)="1635:  TIU GET RECORD TEXT "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,27,0)="3954:  TIU SET DOCUMENT TEXT "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,28,0)="1790:  TIU SIGN RECORD "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,29,0)="3194:  TIU AUTHORIZATION "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,30,0)="6083:  TIU GET DOCUMENT STATUS "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH",2,1,31,0)="1841:  ORWRP REPORT TEXT "
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH","B","1 SEQ #1",1)=""
^DIC(9.4,242,22,1,"PAH","B","2 SEQ #2",2)=""
^DIC(9.4,242,22,"B","1.0",1)=""
^DIC(9.4,242,"VERSION")="1.0"
^DIC(9.4,243,0)="CRMS Salesforce^CRMS^RPC's and API's supporting Salesforce Rest Requests"
^DIC(9.4,243,22,0)="^9.49I^1^1"
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,0)="1.0"
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",0)="^9.4901^2^2"
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,0)="0^3240930.175932^89"
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,0)="^^324^324^3240930"
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,1,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,2,0)="Subject:  VCC SALESFORCE CRM SUPPORT"
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,3,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,4,0)="Category:  ROUTINE"
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,5,0)="           OTHER"
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,6,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,7,0)="Description:"
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,8,0)="==========="
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,9,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,10,0)="The CRMS*1.0*0 patch delivers the necessary components for the support of "
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,11,0)="the SalesForce Customer Relations Management (CRM) project, Outpatient"
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,12,0)="Pharmacy requirements, on the VistA level.  It has been designed to"
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,13,0)="provide REST services for the Java scripted calls used by the SalesForce"
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,14,0)="User Interface."
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,15,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,16,0)="The patch releases the necessary Remote Procedure Calls (RPCs) and "
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,17,0)="ENTITY (#1.5) file entries for retrieval of VistA data from a VistA"
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,18,0)="instance.  The patch supports the operations of the Virtual Care Centers,"
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,19,0)="Outpatient Pharmacy, as well as individual patient-related requests."
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,20,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,21,0)="In addition, there is a post-install routine that will add the CRMS WEB"
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,22,0)="CHART menu context to the connector proxy user."
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,23,0)=" "
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,24,0)="****NOTE****  There are post-install instructions for setting up the "
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,25,0)="connector proxy user. These MUST be completed for these patch components"
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,26,0)="to function.  These instructions were also included in patch PSO*7.0*642."
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,27,0)="If completed during installation of patch PSO*7.0*642, the"
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,28,0)="Post-installation instructions in this patch may be ignored."
^DIC(9.4,243,22,1,"PAH",1,1,29,0)=" "
